{"products":[{"id":10514869813515,"title":"Lustra LED  Harman, 29W, 8 Surse, Lumina Neutra, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-harman-29w-8-surse-lumina-neutra-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eLustra LED cu telecomanda Hardman este prevazuta cu 6 surse de lumina avand un design liniar si un stil elegant. Functioneaza la o tensiune de 220–230V, are o putere totala de \u003cstrong data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"254\"\u003e29W\u003c\/strong\u003e si se monteaza pe tavan. Structura este realizata din \u003cstrong data-end=\"325\" data-start=\"316\"\u003emetal\u003c\/strong\u003e, finisaj \u003cstrong data-end=\"344\" data-start=\"335\"\u003enegru\u003c\/strong\u003e, cu o inaltime de \u003cstrong data-end=\"372\" data-start=\"363\"\u003e10 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e si o lungime de \u003cstrong data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"389\"\u003e120 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e. Este compatibila cu intrerupator \u003cstrong data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"434\"\u003eclasic si telecomanda\u003c\/strong\u003e, functioneaza cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"494\" data-start=\"477\"\u003elumina neutra\u003c\/strong\u003e si este recomandata pentru \u003cstrong data-end=\"553\" data-start=\"522\"\u003edormitor, living sau dining\u003c\/strong\u003e. Autonomia este de \u003cstrong data-end=\"584\" data-start=\"573\"\u003e25.000h\u003c\/strong\u003e, protectia este de tip \u003cstrong data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"608\"\u003eIP20\u003c\/strong\u003e, iar utilizarea este destinata interiorului.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-03-25T21:32:08+02:00","created_at":"2025-06-23T16:03:54+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","BF2025","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52080438968587,"ti