stetică rafinată, cât și funcționalitate avansată. Designul circular suprapus creează un efect vizual dinamic, transformând corpul de iluminat într-un punct central al încăperii.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"441\" data-start=\"417\"\u003eSpecificații tehnice\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"442\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"461\" data-start=\"442\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"461\" data-start=\"444\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"444\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 71W\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"462\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"464\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"479\" data-start=\"464\"\u003eTip lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rece \/ Caldă \/ Neutră (selectabilă)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"518\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"566\" data-start=\"520\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"520\"\u003eFuncție dimare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Da – reglare intensitate\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"567\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"569\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"581\" data-start=\"569\"\u003eControl:\u003c\/strong\u003e Telecomandă inclusă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"604\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"606\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"606\"\u003eDimensiuni:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50 x 25 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"635\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"637\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"637\"\u003eÎnălțime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Reglabilă (sistem de suspendare ajustabil)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"718\" data-start=\"696\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"718\" data-start=\"698\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"710\" data-start=\"698\"\u003eCuloare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Auriu\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cl