]:mt-5\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-10\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"13bacc8f-850f-4738-bb68-957be62e0ed8\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"347\"\u003eLustra LED 8056WH aduce un design modern și minimalist, cu finisaj elegant din \u003cstrong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"153\"\u003eacril alb\u003c\/strong\u003e, potrivit pentru orice tip de interior contemporan. Cu \u003cstrong\u003e57\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"229\"\u003eW LED integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferă o iluminare puternică și uniformă, reglabilă pe trei trepte de temperatură a luminii: caldă, neutră și rece.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"581\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"362\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 57W LED integrat\u003cbr data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"382\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"408\"\u003eTemperatură culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000K (caldă) \/ 4000K (neutră) \/ 6000K (rece)\u003cbr data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"457\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"472\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Acril + Metal\u003cbr data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"489\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"503\"\u003eFinisaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alb modern\u003cbr data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"517\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\"\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideală pentru living, dormitor, dining, birou\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"726\"\u003eLustra LED 8056WH combină eficiența energetică cu un design curat și versatil, oferind atât \u003cstrong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"694\"\u003efuncționalitate\u003c\/strong\u003e, cât și \u003cstrong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"723\"\u003eestetică modernă.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\u003cdiv aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px\"\u003e\u003cbutton class=\"text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg\" aria-label=\"Copy\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-testid=\"copy-turn-action-button\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center\"\u003e\u003csvg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" class=\"icon\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.4625