nteligentă. Cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"191\" data-start=\"168\"\u003e3 elemente elegante\u003c\/strong\u003e și finisaj \u003cstrong data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"203\"\u003enegru mat\u003c\/strong\u003e, aduce un aer sofisticat oricărui interior. Puterea de \u003cstrong data-end=\"292\" data-start=\"272\"\u003e41W LED integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e asigură iluminare eficientă, iar prin \u003cstrong data-end=\"354\" data-start=\"331\"\u003etelecomanda inclusă\u003c\/strong\u003e poți regla intensitatea și temperatura luminii: \u003cstrong data-end=\"450\" data-start=\"403\"\u003e3000K (caldă), 4000K (neutră), 6000K (rece)\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"455\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"468\" data-start=\"457\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 41W LED integrat\u003cbr data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"490\"\u003eTemperatură culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000K \/ 4000K \/ 6000K\u003cbr data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"536\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"553\" data-start=\"541\"\u003eFuncții:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimabilă, control prin telecomandă\u003cbr data-end=\"591\" data-start=\"588\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"593\"\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3 elemente moderne, finisaj negru\u003cbr data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"638\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"656\" data-start=\"643\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal + Acril\u003cbr data-end=\"673\" data-start=\"670\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"675\"\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Living, dining, dormitor, birou, spații moderne\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"883\" data-start=\"741\"\u003eAceastă lustra LED este alegerea ideală pentru cei care doresc \u003cstrong data-end=\"848\" data-start=\"804\"\u003econfort, eficiență și design contemporan\u003c\/strong\u003e într-un singur corp de iluminat.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:223\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"