ontainer\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary tts-removed ng-star-inserted\" id=\"05eff12602d2cf0a\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container ng-tns-c1310598610-31 response-container-with-gpi tts-removed ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c1310598610-31\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c1310598610-31\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c1310598610-31\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_05eff12602d2cf0a\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED RONDA Magno\u003c\/strong\u003e cu telecomanda 78W, iti ofera control complet asupra luminii din casa. Design geometric cu patru patrate, finisaj alb mat, materiale solide: metal si acril. Ai trei tipuri de lumina (rece, calda, neutra), toate reglabile din telecomanda – ajustezi intensitatea si temperatura de culoare cum vrei. Se poate schimba tipul de lumina si din intrerupatorul clasic, prin apasari succesive.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFlux luminos puternic, 6240lm, suficient pentru camere mari. Consum redus, durata de viata 25.000 ore. Merge in living, dormitor, bucatarie sau birou. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:188\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2026-05-03T23:24:40+03:00","created_at":"2026-04-24T15:24:06+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","ciresar","Corpuri de Iluminat","IULIE25","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":53072418963723,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT763\/4WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"219.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"219.99","position":1,"product_id":10945784676619,"created_at":"2026-04-24T15:24:07+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":68584465826059,"created_at":"2026-04-29T15:32:08+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-04-29T15:36:22+03:00","product_id":10945784676619,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage24apr.2026_15_25_21_39f629ba-04d7-4374-9f13-334bf4c819fe.png?v=1777466182","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68584463433995,"created_at":"2026-04-29T15:31:52+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-04-29T15:34:04+03:00","product_id":10945784676619,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage24apr.2026_15_25_21_db71fafd-345e-4eff-9cd9-c5d047d72182.png?v=1777466044","width":832,"height":832},{"id":68584465465611,"created_at":"2026-04-29T15:32:02+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-04-29T15:35:21+03:00","product_id":10945784676619,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage24apr.2026_15_25_21_2664e68b-7651-4d2f-9fac-00adce9c2571.png?v=1777466121","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68584467267851,"created_at":"2026-04-29T15:32:17+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-04-29T15:37:20+03:00","product_id":10945784676619,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage24apr.2026_15_25_21_49434b99-385b-4ec8-a8a7-7ae54798d47c.png?v=1777466240","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68864275054859,"created_at":"2026-05-13T10:19:30+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:19:35+03:00","product_id":10945784676619,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage13mai2026_10_19_23.png?v=1778656775","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":68864258081035,"created_at":"2026-05-13T10:16:00+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:16:04+03:00","product_id":10945784676619,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage13mai2026_10_15_53.png?v=1778656564","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10945797062923,"title":"Lustra LED Ventilator VENTIS cu Telecomanda, 21 W, D80cm, Lumina Rece\/Neutra\/Calda, Metal si Plastic, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-ventilator-21-w-diametru-80-metal-si-plastic-negru","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransformă orice încăpere într-un spațiu modern și funcțional cu această lustră LED cu ventilator integrat și telecomandă. Concepută pentru a combina designul elegant cu utilitatea, oferă atât iluminare eficientă, cât și răcire discretă, într-un singur produs compact.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCu un diametru de 80 cm și finisaj negru mat, lustra se integrează perfect în interioare contemporane, fie că este vorba de living, dormitor sau birou. Ventilatorul silențios asigură o circulație optimă a aerului, iar iluminarea LED de 21W permite alegerea temperaturii de culoare în funcție de momentul zilei sau atmosferă.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eControlul este simplu și rapid datorită telecomenzii incluse, care îți oferă acces la toate funcțiile fără efort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e✨ Beneficii principale:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2 în 1:\u003c\/strong\u003e iluminare LED + ventilator integrat\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTelecomandă inclusă:\u003c\/strong\u003e control facil al luminii și ventilatorului\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3 tipuri de lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e rece, neutră și caldă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEficiență energetică:\u003c\/strong\u003e consum redus de doar 21W\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVentilator silențios:\u003c\/strong\u003e confort fără zgomot\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e finisaj negru elegant, potrivit pentru orice decor\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e🔧 Specificații tehnice:\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePutere: 21W\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiametru: 80 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMaterial: metal + plastic\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCuloare: negru\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTip lumină: rece \/ neutră \/ caldă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eControl: telecomandă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFuncții: iluminare + ventilare\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlege această lustră LED cu ventilator pentru un echilibru perfect între estetică, tehnologie și confort zilnic. Ideală pentru cei care își doresc un ambient plăcut, modern și eficient energetic.\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/f