trong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiametru: \u003cstrong\u003e50 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTemperatură de culoare: \u003cstrong\u003eRece \/ Neutră \/ Caldă\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eControl facil prin \u003cstrong\u003etelecomandă\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTehnologie \u003cstrong\u003eLED integrată\u003c\/strong\u003e, economică și eficientă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMateriale: \u003cstrong\u003eMetal și plastic\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCuloare: \u003cstrong\u003eAlb\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign modern, potrivit pentru diverse stiluri de amenajare\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDistribuție uniformă a luminii\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConsum redus de energie\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVEYA\u003c\/strong\u003e este alegerea ideală pentru cei care își doresc un iluminat modern, eficient și versatil, cu posibilitatea de a adapta atmosfera încăperii prin simpla apăsare a unui buton.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-15T14:32:24+03:00","created_at":"2026-06-09T17:07:17+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":53171428131083,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-CF107WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"539.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"539.99","position":1,"