e. Designul său liniar include un proiector reglabil, totul finisat în alb. Oferă posibilitatea de a alege între lumină rece, caldă sau neutră.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eForma circulara a lustrei si \u003cstrong\u003ediametrul de 20cm\u003c\/strong\u003e indică o prezență vizuală semnificativă. Finisajul alb îi conferă un aspect industrial sau modern.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-29T14:53:52+03:00","created_at":"2026-06-29T09:07:45+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustra LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED Scandinave"],"variants":[{"id":53210277806347,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL7001WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"139.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"119.99","position":1,"product_id":10990760231179,"created_at":"2026-06-29T09:07:47+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69618562334987,"created_at":"2026-06-29T09:48:30+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:00:40+03:00","product_id":10990760231179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_ASADO_14W_Diametru_20cm_Lumina_Calda_Neutra_Rece_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_1.png?v=1782716440","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69618589434123,"created_at":"2026-06-29T09:59:25+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:00:51+03:00","product_id":10990760231179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_ASADO_14W_Diametru_20cm_Lumina_Calda_Neutra_Rece_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_2.png?v=1782716451","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69618569871627,"created_at":"2026-06-29T09:51:48+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:01:02+03:00","product_id":10990760231179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_ASADO_14W_Diametru_20cm_Lumina_Calda_Neutra_Rece_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_3.png?v=1782716462","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69618562302219,"created_at":"2026-06-29T09:48:30+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:01:12+03:00","product_id":10990760231179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_ASADO_14W_Diametru_20cm_Lumina_Calda_Neutra_Rece_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_4.png?v=1782716472","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69618565447947,"created_at":"2026-06-29T09:49:46+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:01:24+03:00","product_id":10990760231179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_ASADO_14W_Diametru_20cm_Lumina_Calda_Neutra_Rece_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_5.png?v=1782716484","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69618524455179,"created_at":"2026-06-29T09:33:33+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:01:32+03:00","product_id":10990760231179,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_ASADO_14W_Diametru_20cm_Lumina_Calda_Neutra_Rece_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_6.png?v=1782716492","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760741032203,"title":"Lustra Architek Hexa, 6xE27, 90x80, Negru, Metal","handle":"lustra-architek-hexa-6-x-e27-negru-metal","body_html":"\u003c!-- codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC368\/6BK --\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_2000x900_LC368-6BK.jpg?v=1785515786\" alt=\"Lustra Architek Hexa, 6xE27, 90x80, Negru, Metal banner\" width=\"2000\" height=\"900\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c!-- \/codex-banner:AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC368\/6BK --\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:298\"\u003eLustra Architek Hexa nu este doar o sursa de lumina, ci o piesa centrala indrazneata, conceputa sa adauge o nota de modernism industrial si un impact vizual puternic in orice interior.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:269\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Sculptural, Geometrie Aerisita:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o structura din brate metalice, finisate in negru mat, ce se extind din centrul lustrei, aceasta piesa creeaza o silueta dinamica, o interpretare sofisticata a stilului industrial, ce atrage privirea si defineste spatiul.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:258\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAura Luminoasa Extinsa, Ambianta Definita:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu sase socluri E27, Lustra Architek Hexa inunda incaperea cu o lumina generoasa si uniforma, ideala pentru a crea o atmosfera calda si primitoare, perfecta pentru socializare sau momente de relaxare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:247\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePrezenta Impunatoare, Proportii Grandioase:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu un diametru de 90 cm si o inaltime de 80 cm, se monteaza elegant pe tavan, oferind o acoperire luminoasa extinsa si un punct focal de design in spatii ample, fara a coplesi estetic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatilitate Estetica, Integrare Fara Efort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Conceputa pentru interioare, se adapteaza fara efort unei game largi de stiluri, de la minimalist si urban la eclectic si contemporan, aducand o nota de rafinament si inovatie in orice context.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:199\"\u003eAceasta lustra nu doar lumineaza functional, ci si transforma fiecare incapere intr-un spatiu vibrant, modern si plin de caracter, un loc unde designul si lumina se intalnesc intr-o armonie perfecta.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:199\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:199\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-e27.jpg?v=1747387419\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:15:45+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:15:44+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre cu bec","Lustre din fier","Lustre Minimaliste"],"variants":[{"id":52424487895307,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC368\/6BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"89.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"159.99","position":1,"product_id":9760741032203,"created_at":"2025-09-29T16:06:33+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69857887256843,"created_at":"2026-07-31T19:36:20+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T19:36:22+03:00","product_id":9760741032203,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/009_09_LC368-6BK.webp?v=1785515782","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857887093003,"created_at":"2026-07-31T19:36:20+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T19:36:22+03:00","product_id":9760741032203,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/004_04_LC368-6BK.webp?v=1785515782","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":69857887027467,"created_at":"2026-07-31T19:36:20+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T19:36:23+03:00","product_id":9760741032203,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/001_01_LC368-6BK.w