","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:312\"\u003eLustra Joom cu Proiector Liniar nu este doar un corp de iluminat, ci un instrument precis, conceput sa accentueze, sa ghideze si sa creeze ambiante dinamice in living, hol sau bucatarie.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:232\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Industrial Pur, Finisaj Mat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o silueta liniara, curata si un finisaj negru mat, acest proiector se integreaza fara efort in interioare moderne, industriale sau chiar eclectice, aducand o nota de sofisticare discreta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:282\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumina Directionata, Control Absolut:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu doua surse de lumina GU10, permite orientarea individuala a fiecarui spot, oferind flexibilitatea de a ilumina obiecte de arta, zone de lucru sau de a accentua textura peretilor, cu o lumina neutra ce reproduce fidel culorile.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:192\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurabilitate Extinsa, Performanta Constantă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o autonomie impresionanta de 25.000 de ore, aceasta lustra promite o prezenta luminoasa de lunga durata, fara compromisuri in performanta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePrezenta Compacta, Impact Maximal:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu dimensiuni de 15.5 cm inaltime, 25 cm lungime si 15 cm latime, se monteaza discret pe tavan, oferind o solutie de iluminat puternica fara a incarca vizual spatiul.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:179\"\u003eLustra Joom nu doar lumineaza functional, ci redefineste modul in care percepi lumina in spatiul tau, oferind un control precis asupra atmosferei si un accent stilistic impecabil.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-gu10.jpg?v=1747387419\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:16:50+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:16:50+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustra LED","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre Clasice Moderne","Lustre cu bec","Lustre cu bec moderne","Plafoniere LED"],"variants":[{"id":52418000290059,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LC500\/2BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"59.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"99.99","position":1,"product_id":9760743358731,"created_at":"2025-09-27T13:37:41+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51854084309259,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:16:51+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T03:16:53+02:00","product_id":9760743358731,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-cu-proiector-2xgu10-eirini-negru-1729610988.webp?v=1740446213","width":900,"height":900},{"id":63557287051531,"created_at":"2025-12-18T11:14:27+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T11:14:31+02:00","product_id":9760743358731,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPS_Photos_1_a6b3c618-5b4d-4cbf-84dd-209e696e6306.png?v=1766049271","width":751,"height":698},{"id":63557287084299,"created_at":"2025-12-18T11:14:27+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T11:14:31+02:00","product_id":9760743358731,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPS_Photos_2_190628f4-0b0a-4491-8b94-5cb1760d059a.png?v=1766049271","width":619,"height":627},{"id":66175691161867,"created_at":"2026-02-22T00:28:58+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-02-22T00:29:00+02:00","product_id":9760743358731,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\