220-230V\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferind o iluminare uniforma si calda. Este recomandata pentru \u003cstrong data-end=\"563\" data-start=\"524\"\u003eliving, dormitor sau zona de dining\u003c\/strong\u003e, fiind potrivita pentru montaj pe \u003cstrong data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"598\"\u003etavan\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"610\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"610\"\u003eConstructie suspendata\u003c\/strong\u003e, cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"668\" data-start=\"641\"\u003eclasa de protectie IP21\u003c\/strong\u003e, se integreaza perfect in spatii moderne, minimaliste sau cu accente naturale. Functionare simpla prin \u003cstrong data-end=\"795\" data-start=\"772\"\u003eintrerupator clasic\u003c\/strong\u003e, conectare \u003cstrong data-end=\"819\" data-start=\"807\"\u003ela retea\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Becurile nu sunt incluse!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner-candelabre-bec-g9.jpg?v=1747387418\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-16T14:47:29+03:00","created_at":"2026-06-12T16:37:27+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustra LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre Clasice Moderne","Lustre cu bec moderne"],"variants":[{"id":53178866434315,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-3177\/39","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"1859.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"1859.99","position":1,"product_id":10978545598731,"created_at":"2026-06-12T16:37:27+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69457433559307,"created_at":"2026-06-12T16:46:46+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T16:54:26+03:00","product_id":10978545598731,"variant_ids":[],"src