jul alb și combinația armonioasă dintre sticlă și rășină, oferă un aspect sofisticat, potrivit atât pentru amenajările contemporane, cât și pentru cele clasice.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCu un diametru de 13 cm si inaltime de 120 cm, lustra creează un efect vizual spectaculos, devenind punctul central al livingului, diningului, holului sau al unui spațiu comercial elegant. Este echipată cu un soclu E27, oferind libertatea de a alege sursa de lumină în funcție de intensitatea și temperatura de culoare dorită. Pentru un consum redus de energie și o durată de viață extinsă, se recomandă utilizarea unui bec LED compatibil.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-16T14:46:57+03:00","created_at":"2026-06-12T15:21:28+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustra LED","tags":["active","Aplice","Aplice de Perete LED","Aplice Decorative","Corpuri de Iluminat"],"variants":[{"id":53178560741643,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-6008WT\/B","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"229.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"229.99","position":1,"product_id":10978416361739,"created_at":"2026-06-12T15:21:29+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69452041650443,"created_at":"2026-06-12T15:23:14+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T15:33:53+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage12iun.2026_15_20_35_7ef7d9c1-69aa-4f7d-8458-7155255319f5.png?v=1781267633","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69555227001099,"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:39:56+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-18T09:41:14+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage18iun.2026_09_30_31.png?v=1781764874","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69555227951371,"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:40:09+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-18T09:43:10+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage18iun.2026_09_30_31_035ab3c6-f9a4-4580-9053-a3a9c711ff5b.png?v=1781764990","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69452038570251,"created_at":"2026-06-12T15:23:05+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T15:28:58+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage12iun.2026_15_20_35.png?v=1781267338","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69555256131851,"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:45:06+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-18T09:46:17+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage18iun.2026_09_30_31_61a78608-4a2c-4eca-ba30-249745b1ed27.png?v=1781765177","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69452036079883,"created_at":"2026-06-12T15:22:52+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T15:35:51+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage12iun.2026_15_20_05.png?v=1781267751","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69555256492299,"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:45:08+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-06-18T09:49:47+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage18iun.2026_09_30_31_40f735d1-3fbb-444b-8627-8e92c0eb19b6.png?v=1781765387","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69455434744075,"created_at":"2026-06-12T16:22:26+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T16:22:30+03:00","product_id":10978416361739,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage12iun.2026_16_22_16.png?v=1781270550","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760363872523,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda cu cristal QUADRIA SUPREMO RGB, 143W, 5 Patrate, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Crom Lucios","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-si-cristal-quadria-supremo-rgb-143w-5-patrate-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-crom-lucios","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eExperimentați magia luminii cu lustra LED Quadria Supremo - o capodoperă de iluminat care transformă orice încăpere într-un spațiu elegant și rafinat. Cu cristale strălucitoare și o gamă variată de lumini, această lustră adaugă o notă de lux și versatilitate în decorul dvs.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCristalele sclipitoare ale lustrei Quadria Supremo adaugă o notă de eleganță și strălucire, transformând lumina într-un spectacol vizual captivant. Cu trei tipuri de lumină - caldă, neutră și rece - puteți alege atmosfera perfectă pentru fiecare moment. De asemenea, dispune de iluminat RGB pentru a crea o atmosferă deosebită. Controlați cu ușurință intensitatea luminii și culoarea folosind telecomanda inclusă, oferindu-vă control total asupra iluminatului din confortul dvs.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLustra Quadria Supremo are o construcție unică cu 5 patrate, aducând un element modern și sofisticat în decorul dvs. Cu o putere impresionantă de 143W și un flux luminos de 11.440 lm, această lustră oferă o iluminare eficientă și puternică, acoperind cu ușurință dormitorul și livingul. Designul elegant în culoare argintie adaugă un strop de lux și rafinament în orice spațiu.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLustra LED Quadria Supremo este ideală pentru dormitor și living, unde poate aduce o atmosferă relaxantă în timpul serilor liniștite și poate transforma încăperea într-un spațiu de socializare plin de strălucire în timpul întâlnirilor cu prietenii și familia. Cu lustra LED Quadria Supremo, iluminatul devine o artă, iar decorul dvs. strălucește într-un mod unic și elegant. Aduceți o notă de eleganță în casa dvs. cu această lustră versatilă și sofisticată.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T02:20:25+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T02:20:25+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale"],"variants":[{"id":52386475999499,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT079\/5","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"399.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"529.99","position":1,"product_id":9760363872523,"created_at":"2025-09-19T12:11:51+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51847889551627,"created_at":"2025-02-25T02:20:26+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T02:20:28+02:00","product_id":9760363872523,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cristal-rgb-cu-telecomanda-destiny-100w-dimabila-argintiu-1693830218.webp?v=1740442828","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51847889977611,"created_at":"2025-02-25T02:20:27+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T02:20:29+02:00","product_id":9760363872523,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cristal-rgb-telecomanda_2886-4_1_02-1693830219.webp?v=1740442829","width":900,"height":900},{"id":52833950335243,"created_at":"2025-04-02T14:36:41+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-04-02T14:36:43+03:00","product_id":9760363872523,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT079_5-LustraLEDQuadriaSupremo_5XElemente_RGB148W_CromPremium_Inox_luminaCalda_Rece_Neutra-1.jpg?v=1743593803","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":52833950302475,"created_at":"2025-04-02T14:36:41+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-04-02T14:36:43+03:00","product_id":9760363872523,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT079_5-LustraLEDQuadriaSupremo_5XElemente_RGB148W_CromPremium_Inox_luminaCalda_Rece_Neutra-2.jpg?v=1743593803","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":64131421602059,"created_at":"2026-01-05T16:26:18+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-01-05T16:26:22+02:00","product_id":9760363872523,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT079_5_EPREL.png?v=1767623182","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10840621023499,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda, LLC160\/750X350GD, Cristal si Metal, 72W, Dimabila, Inaltime Reglabila, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Iluminat Luxos","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-llc160-750x350gd-cristal-si-metal-71w-dimabila-inaltime-reglabila-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-iluminat-luxos","body_html":"\u003cp data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"0\"\u003eLustra LED cu Telecomandă LLC160\/750X350GD este un corp de iluminat premium, conceput pentru interioare elegante și spații moderne care pun accent pe lux și rafinament. Designul său circular, cu un singur cerc decorat cu elemente din cristal și structură metalică aurie, creează un efect vizual spectaculos și o lumină ambientală sofisticată.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"0\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"338\"\u003eCu o putere de 72W, lustra oferă iluminare eficientă și uniformă, fiind ideală pentru livinguri, dininguri sau dormitoare high-end. Funcția dimabilă și telecomanda inclusă permit control total asupra intensității și temperaturii de culoare, cu opțiuni de lumină caldă, neutră sau rece, adaptabile oricărui moment al zilei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"338\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"662\"\u003eÎnălțimea reglabilă asigură flexibilitate maximă la montaj, permițând integrarea armonioasă atât în spații cu tavan înalt, cât și în încăperi standard. Combinația dintre cristalul strălucitor și finisajul metalic auriu transformă lustra LLC160\/750X350GD într-un element statement, care nu doar iluminează, ci definește vizual întregul ambient.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"662\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1001\"\u003eO alegere ideală pentru cei care caută iluminat luxos, tehnologie modernă și control complet al atmosferei într-un singur produs.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-12-29T07:33:16+02:00","created_at":"2025-12-18T15:22:07+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","Ciresar 25","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52772345970955,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LLC160\/750X350GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"799.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"999.99","position":1,"product_id":10840621023499,"created_at":"2025-12-18T15:22:08+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":63569385554187,"created_at":"2025-12-18T15:32:00+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:33:09+02:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Dec_18_2025_03_31_52_PM.png?v=1766064789","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63563612291339,"created_at":"2025-12-18T14:50:11+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:33:09+02:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H2d996933592041908120d27e195020deM.jpg?v=1766064789","width":798,"height":798},{"id":63568044425483,"created_at":"2025-12-18T15:22:46+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:33:09+02:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPS_Photos_1_4916ef5d-2e8e-41a1-86da-d9fd9203ea3c.jpg?v=1766064789","width":3000,"height":3500},{"id":63563612356875,"created_at":"2025-12-18T14:50:12+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:33:09+02:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Hb496331698104612bf830ac2efba6663N.jpg?v=1766064789","width":800,"height":800},{"id":63569399513355,"created_at":"2025-12-18T15:33:45+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:37:52+02:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_6e7e9b3d-348c-4524-ab19-37b562eb3a34.png?v=1766065072","width":2500,"height":2500},{"id":63568758046987,"created_at":"2025-12-18T15:29:31+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:37:52+02:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Dec_18_2025_03_29_12_PM.png?v=1766065072","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63567319761163,"created_at":"2025-12-18T15:19:39+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:37:52+02:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H59011c5fb71441f1827b55e25f8f7330E.jpg?v=1766065072","width":800,"height":800},{"id":68416680952075,"created_at":"2026-04-22T09:56:38+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-04-22T09:56:41+03:00","product_id":10840621023499,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2696806_big_color.svg?v=1776841001","width":136,"height":272}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9779348144395,"title":"Lustră LED Marco cu Telecomandă, 76W, Dimabilă, Auriu, Metal, Acril și Sticlă, 3000K\/4000K\/6000K","handle":"lustra-led-marco-cu-telecomanda-76w-dimabila-auriu-metal-acril-si-sticla-3000k-4000k-6000k","body_html":"\u003cp data-end=\"403\" data-start=\"0\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED Marco\u003c\/strong\u003e este o piesă de iluminat elegantă și funcțională, concepută pentru interioare moderne care pun accent pe detaliu și versatilitate. Realizată dintr-o combinație rafinată de metal, acril și sticlă, cu un finisaj auriu sofisticat, Marco adaugă un plus de stil și lumină în orice spațiu.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"405\"\u003eCu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e76W \u003c\/strong\u003eși LED integrat dimabil, permite ajustarea intensității și a temperaturii de culoare între \u003cstrong\u003e3000K (cald)\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e4000K (neutru)\u003c\/strong\u003e și \u003cstrong\u003e6000K (rece)\u003c\/strong\u003e, prin intermediul \u003cstrong\u003etelecomenzii incluse\u003c\/strong\u003e. Ideală pentru living, dining sau dormitor, oferă iluminare eficientă și control total asupra atmosferei dorite.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"713\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"713\"\u003eSpecificații principale:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"744\" data-start=\"741\"\u003e– Design modern cu finisaj auriu și detalii din sticlă\u003cbr data-end=\"801\" data-start=\"798\"\u003e– Putere 51W, iluminare LED eficientă\u003cbr data-end=\"841\" data-start=\"838\"\u003e– Temperaturi de culoare reglabile: 3000K \/ 4000K \/ 6000K\u003cbr data-end=\"901\" data-start=\"898\"\u003e– Intensitate luminoasă ajustabilă prin telecomandă\u003cbr data-end=\"955\" data-start=\"952\"\u003e– Materiale premium: metal, acril și sticlă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1002\"\u003eUn corp de iluminat statement, cu performanță luminoasă ridicată și estetică sofisticată.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1002\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1002\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1002\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-07-18T22:38:30+03:00","created_at":"2025-03-06T18:45:32+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre Copii","Lustre LED"],"variants":[{"id":52425975202059,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT125GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"469.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"469.99","position":1,"product_id":9779348144395,"created_at":"2025-09-30T01:07:14+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":57443449340171,"created_at":"2025-07-18T10:12:48+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-07-18T10:12:51+03:00","product_id":9779348144395,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/4a87ee36-0d1c-4172-b9b8-748427d483c9.png?v=1752822771","width":1500,"height":1500},{"id":57443637920011,"created_at":"2025-07-18T10:14:36+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T16:42:49+03:00","product_id":9779348144395,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/8b813300-fa6f-44c9-9dd2-86417de2900f.png?v=1781617369","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69522275696907,"created_at":"2026-06-16T16:42:57+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T16:45:36+03:00","product_id":9779348144395,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/8b813300-fa6f-44c9-9dd2-86417de2900f_f4965428-ed5a-4ff7-aa75-c1c02ee5e8b0.png?v=1781617536","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69522276483339,"created_at":"2026-06-16T16:43:07+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T16:54:05+03:00","product_id":9779348144395,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/8b813300-fa6f-44c9-9dd2-86417de2900f_f91e826f-4c45-4ca5-914f-f325feb0525d.png?v=1781618045","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69522927747339,"created_at":"2026-06-16T16:54:16+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T16:54:20+03:00","product_id":9779348144395,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage16iun.2026_16_35_36.png?v=1781618060","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69522927780107,"created_at":"2026-06-16T16:54:16+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T16:54:20+03:00","product_id":9779348144395,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage16iun.2026_16_34_01.png?v=1781618060","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10980897325323,"title":"Lustra LED RENATO Petito cu telecomanda si cristal,  13W, 2 Patrate, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-renato-petito-cu-telecomanda-si-cristal-13w-2-patrate-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:294\"\u003eTransformă-ți spațiul într-un spectacol de lumină și culoare cu \u003cstrong\u003elustra LED RENATO Petito\u003c\/strong\u003e. Designul său contemporan, cu elemente rectangulare elegante în finisaj \u003cstrong\u003ealb\u003c\/strong\u003e, este completat de o putere impresionantă de \u003cstrong\u003e13W\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferind o iluminare amplă și eficientă pentru încăperi mari.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:199\"\u003eDatorită \u003cstrong\u003etelecomenzii incluse\u003c\/strong\u003e, ai control total asupra atmosferei luminoase. Funcția \u003cstrong\u003edimabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminii pentru a crea ambientul perfect pentru orice ocazie.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:252\"\u003ePersonalizează iluminatul în funcție de starea ta de spirit, eveniment sau preferințe, de la tonuri calde și relaxante la culori vibrante și energizante.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:25\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-20:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:78\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Modern și Elegant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Elemente rectangulare în finisaj alb.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:75\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere Impresionantă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13W pentru o iluminare amplă a spațiilor mari.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:87\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTelecomanda Inclusă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Control facil al intensității luminoase și al culorilor\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:88\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFuncție Dimmabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează intensitatea luminoasă pentru a crea ambientul dorit.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:92\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMateriale de Calitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal durabil cu finisaj alb elegant și elemente LED integrate.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"19:1-20:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStil Contemporan și Dinamic:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioarele moderne și eclectice.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:220\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă RENATO Petito \u003c\/strong\u003eeste alegerea ideală pentru a adăuga un plus de stil, confort și culoare în spațiile mari. Bucură-te de iluminarea puternică și adaptabilă, completată de spectrul vibrant al culorilor sale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:220\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-17T18:05:04+03:00","created_at":"2026-06-16T16:56:28+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","ciresar","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":53185491337483,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT764\/2WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"139.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"139.99","position":1,"product_id":10980897325323,"created_at":"2026-06-16T16:56:29+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69524488093963,"created_at":"2026-06-16T17:18:04+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T17:19:19+03:00","product_id":10980897325323,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_2_80d29ca1-9180-4f35-b281-9b7fa798d706.jpg?v=1781619559","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69524488257803,"created_at":"2026-06-16T17:18:07+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T17:20:21+03:00","product_id":10980897325323,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_2_53111bac-6a4b-4aca-aaf8-d3fb9e8087c5.jpg?v=1781619621","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69524488290571,"created_at":"2026-06-16T17:18:09+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T17:21:49+03:00","product_id":10980897325323,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_2_85c8c2da-85da-4912-a00e-c34c55ab3b0b.jpg?v=1781619709","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69524769603851,"created_at":"2026-06-16T17:22:03+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T17:22:07+03:00","product_id":10980897325323,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage16iun.2026_16_58_56_baeebd0d-30d6-49ca-b2fb-4e3c54668815.png?v=1781619727","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69524769636619,"created_at":"2026-06-16T17:22:03+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T17:22:08+03:00","product_id":10980897325323,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage16iun.2026_17_00_30_86a737a5-72c8-47d3-8f58-ddc9ab7818f4.png?v=1781619728","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10134679290123,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda VOLTA 96W, Ovala, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-volta-96w-ovala-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED VOLTA\u003c\/strong\u003e impresionează prin designul său contemporan, cu două cercuri interconectate și un finisaj negru mat ce adaugă profunzime și rafinament oricărui spațiu. Cu o putere de 96W, oferă iluminare eficientă și uniformă, ideală pentru încăperi medii sau mari. Ai posibilitatea de a alege între lumină rece, caldă sau neutră, iar intensitatea luminoasă este ușor de reglat prin telecomanda inclusă. Perfectă pentru living, dining sau birou, \u003cstrong\u003eVOLTA \u003c\/strong\u003eîmbină funcționalitatea modernă cu un design versatil și expresiv.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T15:37:29+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-15T12:13:11+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","Back2school","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52429939278091,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT641\/500BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"279.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"359.99","position":1,"product_id":10134679290123,"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:57:02+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":54781278617867,"created_at":"2025-04-15T12:19:54+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T15:23:01+03:00","product_id":10134679290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT641_500BK-LustraLEDcutelecomandaORBITANERO_125W_OVALA_luminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-1.png?v=1781612581","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69517941768459,"created_at":"2026-06-16T15:21:14+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T15:25:26+03:00","product_id":10134679290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT641_500BK-LustraLEDcutelecomandaORBITANERO_125W_OVALA_luminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-1_2558e9d6-40e8-4d0f-b5d6-b7b2640712e4.png?v=1781612726","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69517987578123,"created_at":"2026-06-16T15:26:55+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T15:29:02+03:00","product_id":10134679290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage16iun.2026_15_22_18.png?v=1781612942","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69517941866763,"created_at":"2026-06-16T15:21:14+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T15:26:36+03:00","product_id":10134679290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT641_500BK-LustraLEDcutelecomandaORBITANERO_125W_OVALA_luminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-1_58ea3357-a59d-43b4-8781-859f7abe6b81.png?v=1781612796","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69517986726155,"created_at":"2026-06-16T15:26:43+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T15:26:45+03:00","product_id":10134679290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2697179_big_color.png?v=1781612805","width":425,"height":850},{"id":69517988659467,"created_at":"2026-06-16T15:27:12+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T15:27:16+03:00","product_id":10134679290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage16iun.2026_15_22_18_d4f1a002-7398-4c0c-88a7-589f05af31fa.png?v=1781612836","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69517998915851,"created_at":"2026-06-16T15:30:03+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-06-16T15:30:10+03:00","product_id":10134679290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage16iun.2026_15_29_54.png?v=1781613010","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9779351290123,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda LINEX, 108W, 8 elemente, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-linex-108w-8-elemente-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED LINEX cu telecomandă (8 brațe)\u003c\/strong\u003e este un corp de iluminat modern și foarte puternic, ideal pentru încăperi unde ai nevoie atât de lumină intensă, cât și de control total asupra atmosferei. Oferă \u003cstrong\u003e108W \u003c\/strong\u003eși un flux luminos generos de \u003cstrong\u003e8640lm\u003c\/strong\u003e, suficient pentru a ilumina uniform un living, dormitor sau hol de dimensiuni mari.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLumina este \u003cstrong\u003edimmabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e, cu trei temperaturi selectabile – \u003cstrong\u003e3000K, 4000K și 6000K\u003c\/strong\u003e – astfel încât poți alege rapid între o atmosferă caldă, neutră sau rece, în funcție de nevoi. Controlul se realizează ușor prin \u003cstrong\u003etelecomandă\u003c\/strong\u003e, dar și prin \u003cstrong\u003eîntrerupătorul clasic\u003c\/strong\u003e, ceea ce o face compatibilă cu orice tip de instalație electrică. Funcționează la \u003cstrong\u003e220–230V\u003c\/strong\u003e și are o durată de viață de aproximativ \u003cstrong\u003e25.000 ore\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesignul este unul contemporan, caracterizat de \u003cstrong\u003e8 brațe lineare\u003c\/strong\u003e, finisaj negru și combinația vizuală dintre \u003cstrong\u003emetal și acril\u003c\/strong\u003e, detalii care oferă un aspect premium și minimalist. Montajul este aplicat pe tavan, iar dimensiunile de \u003cstrong\u003e65 × 23.5 × 13.5 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e permit integrarea în multiple spații fără a încărca vizual camera. Clasa de protecție \u003cstrong\u003eIP20\u003c\/strong\u003e o recomandă pentru utilizare în interior.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eO alegere excelentă dacă îți dorești \u003cstrong\u003eputere mare de iluminare\u003c\/strong\u003e, flexibilitate deplină și un design modern, potrivit pentru \u003cstrong\u003eliving, dormitor sau hol\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-20T11:47:34+03:00","created_at":"2025-03-06T18:48:00+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","Back2school","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52424305049867,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT171\/8BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"339.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"399.99","position":1,"product_id":9779351290123,"created_at":"2025-09-29T14:46:39+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":56589087113483,"created_at":"2025-06-20T11:36:55+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-20T11:36:59+03:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT1718BK-LustraLEDcuTelecomandaAroldo_90W_LuminaReceCaldaNeutra_Dimabila_Negru-1.png?v=1750408619","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":56589086753035,"created_at":"2025-06-20T11:36:55+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:54+02:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT1718BK-LustraLEDcuTelecomandaAroldo_90W_LuminaReceCaldaNeutra_Dimabila_Negru-2.png?v=1764853614","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":66220274712843,"created_at":"2026-02-22T18:47:31+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-08T14:27:03+03:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT171_8BK.webp?v=1778239623","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63001173295371,"created_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:21+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-05-08T14:34:15+03:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_33bfa984-bb53-40a2-9b9a-eaabb8809b49.png?v=1778240055","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63001173688587,"created_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:27+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:54+02:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT1718BK_2.png?v=1764853614","width":800,"height":800},{"id":63001173721355,"created_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:27+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:54+02:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT1718BK_1.png?v=1764853614","width":1586,"height":1586},{"id":68772273094923,"created_at":"2026-05-08T14:32:47+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-05-08T14:32:51+03:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage8mai2026_14_32_38.png?v=1778239971","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":63001174475019,"created_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:34+02:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2025-12-04T15:06:54+02:00","product_id":9779351290123,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT171_8BK_EPREL.png?v=1764853614","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10153120727307,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata RICCI 25W, 2 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Negru, Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-ricci-25w-2-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-negru-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:86\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEleganță Modernă și Control Inteligent al Luminii: Lustra LED cu  RICCI\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:236\"\u003eAdaugă un plus de stil contemporan și versatilitate în iluminatul casei tale cu lustra LED RICCI. Designul său minimalist, compus din \u003cstrong\u003edouă cercuri elegante\u003c\/strong\u003e, finisate în \u003cstrong\u003enegru\u003c\/strong\u003e, aduce un aer sofisticat și modern oricărui interior.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:236\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:181\"\u003eCu o putere eficientă de \u003cstrong\u003e25W\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustra RICCI oferă o iluminare uniformă și plăcută. Bucură-te de flexibilitatea \u003cstrong\u003etrei tipuri de lumină\u003c\/strong\u003e integrate, adaptabile oricărei atmosfere:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:80\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRece (alb):\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideală pentru activități care necesită concentrare și energie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:95\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCaldă (galben):\u003c\/strong\u003e Creează un ambient primitor și relaxant, perfect pentru serile liniștite.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNeutră:\u003c\/strong\u003e O lumină echilibrată, potrivită pentru utilizarea zilnică.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:233\"\u003eUn avantaj suplimentar este \u003cstrong\u003eînălțimea regrabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e, care îți permite să ajustezi suspendarea lustrei în funcție de înălțimea tavanului și de preferințele tale estetice. Astfel, se integrează armonios în diverse tipuri de interioare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:25\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"21:1-28:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:74\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Modern și Minimalist:\u003c\/strong\u003e Două cercuri elegante cu finisaj negru.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:73\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere Eficientă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 25W, oferind o iluminare bună cu un consum redus.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:88\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrei Tipuri de Lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rece, Caldă și Neutră, pentru a se potrivi oricărei ocazii.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:94\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eÎnălțime Regrabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Flexibilitate pentru a se adapta diferitelor înălțimi ale tavanului.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"27:1-28:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStil Versatil:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioare moderne, scandinave sau minimaliste.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:14\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"31:1-36:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:104\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Versatilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alege temperatura de culoare potrivită pentru fiecare moment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:81\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdaptabilitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Înălțimea regrabilă o face potrivită pentru diverse spații.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"34:1-34:81\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficiență Energetică LED:\u003c\/strong\u003e Consum redus de energie și durată de viață lungă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"35:1-36:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Elegant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Un element de decor modern și discret.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:195\"\u003eLustra LED  RICCI este alegerea ideală pentru a adăuga un plus de stil, confort și control în iluminatul casei tale. \u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T17:57:15+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-27T22:48:01+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","All Stock","BF2025","Ciresar 25","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52425976742155,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL104\/2BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"149.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"149.99","position":1,"product_id":10153120727307,"created_at":"2025-09-30T01:07:36+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":59009069449483,"created_at":"2025-08-11T14:53:37+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:15:29+03:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/27df232f-fcf3-4f16-af3a-bcf70ab537e9.png?v=1779797729","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":59010276589835,"created_at":"2025-08-11T15:13:24+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:11:48+03:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/7252fb16-8eba-4f55-9f52-9e9a36249ea0_e0dfc354-0e7f-462d-91dc-0147d5cd87ae.png?v=1779797508","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63032919130379,"created_at":"2025-12-05T13:20:25+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:13:17+03:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a5_51d32f60-2bf0-4eec-9bcd-f73c8daa4975.png?v=1779797597","width":909,"height":909},{"id":59010310799627,"created_at":"2025-08-11T15:16:41+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:14:06+03:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_5b12e9d0-8dd8-4442-bd52-82d67778a5be.png?v=1779797646","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":59010310865163,"created_at":"2025-08-11T15:16:42+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:10:36+03:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_eb191230-89a5-44e8-8459-929998f3af97.png?v=1779797436","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63032886853899,"created_at":"2025-12-05T13:17:53+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T13:20:38+02:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL1042BK_1.png?v=1764933638","width":1586,"height":1586},{"id":63032884822283,"created_at":"2025-12-05T13:17:39+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T15:44:31+02:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/UNIVERSAL_1_acc25a70-7e85-45d2-85d8-c41acd616ae9.png?v=1764942271","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":69114169032971,"created_at":"2026-05-26T15:15:52+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:22:45+03:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/7252fb16-8eba-4f55-9f52-9e9a36249ea0_63844cdb-d635-42d6-8258-b0bbe09cfed7.png?v=1779798165","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69114150158603,"created_at":"2026-05-26T15:11:54+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-05-26T15:11:58+03:00","product_id":10153120727307,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage26mai2026_15_11_36.png?v=1779797518","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10967533125899,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda si cristal FLORA 82W, 6 Petale, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-si-cristal-flora-82w-6-petale-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eTransformă orice încăpere într-un spațiu elegant și modern cu \u003cstrong\u003elustra LED FLORA\u003c\/strong\u003e, un corp de iluminat spectaculos cu design floral și finisaj premium alb mat. \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCele 6 petale iluminate oferă un efect vizual rafinat, iar inserțiile cu aspect cristal adaugă un plus de stil și lumină ambientală.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfectă pentru living, dormitor, dining sau birou, lustra dispune de funcție dimabilă și control complet al temperaturii de culoare – lumină rece, caldă sau neutră – pentru a crea atmosfera ideală în orice moment al zilei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCaracteristici principale:\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePutere: 82W\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign modern floral cu 6 petale\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCuloare corp: Alb\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFuncție dimabilă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 tipuri de lumină:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCaldă (3000K)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeutră (4000K)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRece (6000K)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTelecomandă inclusă pentru control facil\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConsum redus de energie\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIluminare uniformă și confort vizual\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eElemente decorative cu efect cristal\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMateriale premium și durabilitate ridicată\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAvantaje:\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSchimbi intensitatea și temperatura luminii direct din telecomandă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign elegant potrivit interioarelor moderne\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeală pentru încăperi medii și mari\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMontaj pe tavan, aspect minimalist și sofisticat\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLED integrat cu durată lungă de viață\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eLustra FLORA îmbină perfect estetica modernă cu funcționalitatea inteligentă, oferind un iluminat personalizabil și un impact vizual deosebit în orice decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-21T15:22:13+03:00","created_at":"2026-05-28T09:40:18+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","ciresar","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":53138296963339,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT105\/6WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"289.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"289.99","position":1,"product_id":10967533125899,"created_at":"2026-05-28T09:40:19+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69154541732107,"created_at":"2026-05-28T09:41:22+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-28T09:44:39+03:00","product_id":10967533125899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT105_6WH.jpg?v=1779950679","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69154586886411,"created_at":"2026-05-28T09:42:19+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-28T09:45:55+03:00","product_id":10967533125899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT105_6WH_4ddfc778-7ee1-473b-b049-d5faa89da9f6.jpg?v=1779950755","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69154587967755,"created_at":"2026-05-28T09:42:28+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-28T09:50:43+03:00","product_id":10967533125899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT105_6WH_d5af8f9a-455a-409a-b3fb-71dc223c35ad.jpg?v=1779951043","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69154541666571,"created_at":"2026-05-28T09:41:22+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-05-28T09:41:27+03:00","product_id":10967533125899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage28mai2026_09_38_56.png?v=1779950487","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69154541699339,"created_at":"2026-05-28T09:41:22+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-05-28T09:43:36+03:00","product_id":10967533125899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT105_6WH.png?v=1779950616","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10968402460939,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda, Suspendata AMI 78W, Liniara, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Alb, Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-suspendata-ami-63w-liniara-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-alb-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED cu Telecomandă AMI 63W, Liniară, Auriu\u003c\/strong\u003e este un corp de iluminat modern, cu design minimalist și formă liniară, potrivit pentru living, dining sau bucătărie. Finisajul auriu oferă un aspect elegant și ușor de integrat în interioare contemporane.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCu o putere de 63W, asigură iluminare eficientă și uniformă. Dispune de trei temperaturi de culoare – lumină rece, neutră și caldă – selectabile prin telecomandă, pentru adaptarea atmosferei în funcție de momentul zilei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eModelul este prevăzut cu înălțime reglabilă, permițând ajustarea în funcție de spațiu și preferințe. Dimensiuni: lungime 120 cm, lățime 24 cm. Tehnologia LED integrată oferă consum redus și durată de viață extinsă.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:236\"\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner_0b38953e-6df8-4961-a1b4-2f466d0e92f6.webp?v=1772544229\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:236\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-21T15:27:09+03:00","created_at":"2026-05-29T10:54:51+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":53141100822795,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT5003WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"529.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"529.99","position":1,"product_id":10968402460939,"created_at":"2026-05-29T10:54:51+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69181101211915,"created_at":"2026-05-29T11:09:52+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:11:54+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_6dad26ab-99ca-469f-a8cd-72d1ce6c1915.png?v=1780042314","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69181078700299,"created_at":"2026-05-29T11:07:25+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:09:26+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_02983b85-f784-4448-890f-3086b75419da.png?v=1780042166","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69181401596171,"created_at":"2026-05-29T11:12:35+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:14:39+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_5f29ab9e-0688-4a6b-aeef-2b90977fb189.png?v=1780042479","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69180422193419,"created_at":"2026-05-29T10:55:53+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:04:14+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/candelabru-cristal-led-80w-ami-120cm-1737372462_26dbf733-44d1-4cd0-bd7c-ac42e7629cc6.webp?v=1780041854","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69180422160651,"created_at":"2026-05-29T10:55:53+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:05:56+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/850aa0cb-aac5-4829-96f3-7e23e35c8735-1737801845_e1a05a87-cb17-4f75-9367-afe307767020.webp?v=1780041956","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69180422127883,"created_at":"2026-05-29T10:55:53+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:07:09+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a4-1737801845_cbbe101f-5481-4615-a4a2-6cb538775804.webp?v=1780042029","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69181421060363,"created_at":"2026-05-29T11:15:02+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:17:09+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_0b16ecda-1817-4e2f-892c-dc93f8d60c0c.png?v=1780042629","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69183206883595,"created_at":"2026-05-29T11:40:17+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-05-29T11:40:21+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage29mai2026_11_40_04.png?v=1780044021","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":70023072186635,"created_at":"2026-09-01T14:41:17+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-09-01T14:41:19+03:00","product_id":10968402460939,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2836462_big_color.png?v=1788262879","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10996919533835,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda BLUM, 108W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb, Metal si Acril","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-blum-108w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb-metal-si-acril","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:79\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUn Accent de Modernitate și Control Luminos Personalizat: Lustra LED BLUM\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:234\"\u003eTransformă-ți spațiul cu eleganța minimalistă și funcționalitatea inteligentă a lustrei LED BLUM. Designul său contemporan, definit de linii curate și o nuanță \u003cb\u003ealba \u003c\/b\u003esofisticată, aduce un aer modern și stilat în orice încăpere.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:194\"\u003eCu o putere eficientă de \u003cstrong\u003e108W\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustra BLUM oferă o iluminare versatilă, adaptabilă oricărei nevoi. Explorează spectrul complet de lumină cu cele \u003cstrong\u003etrei temperaturi de culoare\u003c\/strong\u003e disponibile:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:82\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAlb rece:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stimulant și ideal pentru a spori concentrarea în zonele de lucru.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:107\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAlb cald:\u003c\/strong\u003e Primitor și relaxant, perfect pentru a crea o atmosferă confortabilă în zonele de relaxare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAlb neutru:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echilibrat și versatil, potrivit pentru iluminatul general al casei.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:231\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTelecomanda inclusă\u003c\/strong\u003e îți oferă puterea de a modela lumina după preferințele tale. Ajustează intensitatea cu funcția \u003cstrong\u003edimmabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e, creând o ambianță luminoasă vibrantă sau o lumină ambientală subtilă, totul cu o simplă atingere.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:58\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGILDIS: Simplitate elegantă, control luminos intuitiv.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:29\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Esențiale:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"19:1-25:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:73\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Minimalist Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Linii curate și finisaj negru sofisticat.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:73\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Adaptabilă (108W):\u003c\/strong\u003e Putere eficientă pentru diverse spații.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:77\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSpectru Luminos Complet:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alb rece, cald și neutru, pentru orice moment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:83\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl Personalizat (Dimmabilă):\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează intensitatea luminii cu ușurință.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:78\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConfort Inteligent (Telecomandă):\u003c\/strong\u003e Gestionează iluminatul de la distanță.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"24:1-25:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEstetică Versatilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează armonios în diverse stiluri de interior.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:24\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii Resimțite:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"28:1-33:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:83\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdaptează Lumina Perfect:\u003c\/strong\u003e Creează atmosfera ideală pentru fiecare activitate.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:82\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEleganță Subtilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul minimalist adaugă un plus de stil fără a copleși.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:71\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl Fără Efort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Telecomanda face ajustările rapide și comode.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:73\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Eficientă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Te bucuri de lumină optimă cu un consum redus.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"32:1-33:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrare Armonioasă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se potrivește cu ușurință în decorul existent.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"34:1-34:225\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă BLUM nu este doar un corp de iluminat, ci o combinație de design modern și control inteligent, oferindu-ți flexibilitatea de a crea exact lumina de care ai nevoie, cu un stil minimalist și elegant.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-06T10:47:26+03:00","created_at":"2026-07-06T09:43:38+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":53223450116363,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT103\/8WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"319.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"199.99","position":1,"product_id":10996919533835,"created_at":"2026-07-06T09:43:38+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69701195628811,"created_at":"2026-07-06T09:47:47+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T10:13:32+03:00","product_id":10996919533835,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_BLUM_108W_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_1.png?v=1783322012","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69701196480779,"created_at":"2026-07-06T09:48:05+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T10:13:42+03:00","product_id":10996919533835,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_BLUM_108W_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_Metal_si_Acril2.png?v=1783322022","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69701196546315,"created_at":"2026-07-06T09:48:07+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T10:13:51+03:00","product_id":10996919533835,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_BLUM_108W_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabil