h":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51856200040715,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:46:42+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:32:03+03:00","product_id":9760900186379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_Telecomanda_Suspendata_AMI_63W_Liniara_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Auriu_Inaltime_Reglabila_6.webp?v=1783067523","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51856199942411,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:46:42+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:32:14+03:00","product_id":9760900186379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_Telecomanda_Suspendata_AMI_63W_Liniara_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Auriu_Inaltime_Reglabila_77372462.webp?v=1783067534","width":832,"height":832},{"id":69638343229707,"created_at":"2026-07-01T16:56:08+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:32:24+03:00","product_id":9760900186379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_Telecomanda_Suspendata_AMI_63W_Liniara_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Auriu_Inaltime_Reglabila_8.png?v=1783067544","width":1269,"height":1240},{"id":69658287341835,"created_at":"2026-07-03T11:30:29+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:32:34+03:00","product_id":9760900186379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_Telecomanda_Suspendata_AMI_63W_Liniara_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Auriu_Inaltime_Reglabila_9.png?v=1783067554","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69658274136331,"created_at":"2026-07-03T11:25:28+03:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:32:44+03:00","product_id":9760900186379,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_Telecomanda_Suspendata_AMI_63W_Liniara_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Auriu_Inaltime_Reglabila_10.png?v=1783067564","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10247031357707,"title":"Plafoniera LED SOLIS, D47cm, 70W, Lumina Rece 6000K, Auriu","handle":"plafoniera-led-luma-70w-lumina-rece-auriu","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:274\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlafoniera LED SOLIS\u003c\/strong\u003e, o solutie de iluminat ce redefinedeste spatiul printr-o estetica minimalista si o performanta luminoasa remarcabila. Conceputa pentru a adauga un accent modern si functional, aceasta plafoniera este alegerea ideala pentru interioarele contemporane.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"3:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:294\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Elegant \u0026amp; Profil Subtire:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o \u003cstrong\u003eforma de cerc\u003c\/strong\u003e si un finisaj \u003cstrong\u003eauriu \u003c\/strong\u003esofisticat, realizata din \u003cstrong\u003emetal si acril\u003c\/strong\u003e, aceasta plafoniera se monteaza \u003cstrong\u003eaplicat pe tavan\u003c\/strong\u003e, integrandu-se discret in orice decor modern. Are o inaltime de doar \u003cstrong\u003e3.5 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e si un diametru de \u003cstrong\u003e47 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"4:1-4:252\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Clare si Eficienta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Beneficiati de o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e70W\u003c\/strong\u003e si un \u003cstrong\u003eflux luminos de 5600lm\u003c\/strong\u003e, cu o \u003cstrong\u003elumina rece de 6000K\u003c\/strong\u003e. Aceasta asigura o vizibilitate excelenta si o atmosfera energizanta, controlabila printr-un \u003cstrong\u003eintrerupator clasic\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFiabilitate pe Termen Lung:\u003c\/strong\u003e Echipata cu \u003cstrong\u003ebanda LED\u003c\/strong\u003e, plafoniera ofera o \u003cstrong\u003eautonomie de 25.000 de ore\u003c\/strong\u003e, garantand o utilizare indelungata si costuri reduse de intretinere. Este recomandata pentru \u003cstrong\u003ebucatarie, hol, living, baie, dressing, birou sau dormitor\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:184\"\u003eAceasta Plafoniera LED este alegerea perfecta pentru cei ce cauta o combinatie de eficienta, estetica si durabilitate, transformand orice incapere intr-un spatiu vibrant si functional.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-17T13:05:19+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-12T13:29:31+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Plafoniere LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Plafoniere LED"],"variants":[{"id":52428836471051,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-PL100\/47GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"119.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"119.99","position":1,"product_id":10247031357707,"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:38:10+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":60806070993163,"created_at":"2025-09-30T12:17:36+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:34:49+03:00","product_id":10247031357707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Haf00168b32ea482c8089a05b891fc0faU.jpg?v=1781246089","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69448583053579,"created_at":"2026-06-12T09:33:04+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:36:12+03:00","product_id":10247031357707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Haf00168b32ea482c8089a05b891fc0faU_231ea855-ed0b-4022-9bc7-b9c933b601cd.jpg?v=1781246172","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69448658977035,"created_at":"2026-06-12T09:36:23+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:38:05+03:00","product_id":10247031357707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Haf00168b32ea482c8089a05b891fc0faU_81b78108-2347-473c-a964-2794191b223f.jpg?v=1781246285","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":60806037438731,"created_at":"2025-09-30T12:15:46+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-09-30T12:15:49+03:00","product_id":10247031357707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H3d50b969910b44e18b178f240c541f36E.jpg?v=1759223749","width":790,"height":790},{"id":60806037471499,"created_at":"2025-09-30T12:15:46+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-09-30T12:15:48+03:00","product_id":10247031357707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H036c7c9b4a034d4b961f1469b049182c6.jpg?v=1759223748","width":800,"height":800},{"id":69448780677387,"created_at":"2026-06-12T09:43:56+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-06-12T09:44:00+03:00","product_id":10247031357707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage12iun.2026_09_43_49.png?v=1781246640","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69998165295371,"created_at":"2026-08-26T09:11:47+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-08-26T09:11:49+03:00","product_id":10247031357707,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2734457_big_color.png?v=1787724709","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760692633867,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu telecomanda INFINITY HALO 69W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru, Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-infinity-halo-69w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă INFINITY HALO, de 69W, este o piesă de iluminat modernă și impresionantă, finisată în negru elegant. Designul său 'Infinity Halo' sugerează un aspect continuu sau multi-dimensional, adesea realizat prin forme circulare sau ondulate. Această lustră oferă o flexibilitate remarcabilă în iluminare, permițând selectarea între lumină rece, caldă și neutră, adaptându-se astfel oricărei ocazii sau preferințe. Funcția de dimare, controlată prin telecomanda inclusă, îți dă posibilitatea de a regla intensitatea luminii pentru a crea atmosfera perfectă. Un avantaj suplimentar este înălțimea reglabilă, care permite adaptarea lustrei la specificul fiecărei încăperi. Cu o putere de 69W, asigură o iluminare generoasă, fiind ideală pentru livinguri spațioase, sufragerii sau alte zone în care se dorește un impact vizual puternic și o lumină adaptabilă. Finisajul negru adaugă un aer sofisticat și contemporan oricărui decor\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:08:32+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:08:31+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Ciresar 25","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52418190016779,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT110BK","requires_shipping":tr