":"2026-07-31T22:26:10+03:00","product_id":10152393933067,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/013_13_LL770-3WH.webp?v=1785525970","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69858352365835,"created_at":"2026-07-31T22:45:04+03:00","position":13,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T22:45:08+03:00","product_id":10152393933067,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/003_03_LL770-3WH.webp?v=1785527108","width":4000,"height":4000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10976293945611,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata ANGLE, D52cm, 25W, Inaltime Reglabila, Lumina Rece, Negru, Metal si Acril","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-angle-d52cm-25w-inaltime-reglabila-lumina-rece-negru-metal-si-acril","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:154\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED ANGLE\u003c\/strong\u003e este o piesă de iluminat modernă și eficientă, cu un design liniar, o putere de 25W și un finisaj negru. Aceasta oferă o lumină rece de 6000K.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:417\"\u003eForma rotunda sugerează o distribuție uniformă a luminii, fiind potrivită pentru deasupra meselor, birourilor sau în alte spații unde se dorește o iluminare funcțională și uniformă.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:417\"\u003eLumina rece este ideală pentru activități care necesită o percepție clară a culorilor și un confort vizual bun. Finisajul negru îi conferă un aspect elegant, ușor de integrat în diverse decoruri moderne.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-15T14:37:32+03:00","created_at":"2026-06-09T15:16:00+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","BF2025","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Suspendate","Plafoniere LED"],"variants":[{"id":53171024822539,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL5001\/600BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"309.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"309.99","position":1,"product_id":10976293945611,"created_at":"2026-06-09T15:16:00+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69378822635787,"created_at":"2026-06-09T15:21:04+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-06-09T15:24:23+03:00","product_id":10976293945611,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_2_2259e12d-aa01-494e-9b1c-929857f078cc.jpg?v=1781007863","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69378823192843,"created_at":"2026-06-09T15:21:13+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-06-09T15:26:40+03:00","product_id":10976293945611,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_2_a6cb58ca-1143-4d3d-9cb3-5f80920fa673.jpg?v=1781008000","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69378823258379,"created_at":"2026-06-09T15:21:15+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-06-09T15:28:18+03:00","product_id":10976293945611,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhoto_2_6af3fbbc-948a-40f4-9692-3c2d1571f9a4.jpg?v=1781008098","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":69378817425675,"created_at":"2026-06-09T15:20:54+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-06-09T15:20:57+03:00","product_id":10976293945611,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage9iun.2026_15_20_21.png?v=1781007657","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69378817458443,"created_at":"2026-06-09T15:20:54+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-09T15:20:58+03:00","product_id":10976293945611,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage9iun.2026_15_20_40.png?v=1781007658","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757720477963,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda IPOMOEA 51W, 3 Stele, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb, Metal si Acril","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-ipomoea-51w-3-stele-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:229\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă IPOMOEA este o opțiune de iluminat modernă și jucăușă, cu un design format din 3 stele stilizate, finisate în alb. Cu o putere de 51W, aduce o notă de fantezie și o iluminare versatilă în orice încăpere.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:229\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:472\"\u003eCele trei stele, iluminate eficient de LED-uri, nu sunt doar un element decorativ atrăgător, ci și surse de lumină ajustabilă. Prin intermediul telecomenzii, poți schimba temperatura culorii, alegând între lumină rece (pentru un ambient energizant), caldă (pentru o atmosferă primitoare și relaxantă) sau neutră (pentru iluminare generală). Funcția de dimare îți oferă posibilitatea de a regla intensitatea luminii, adaptând-o la orice moment al zilei sau stare de spirit.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:472\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:266\"\u003eFinisajul alb al lustrei o face ușor de integrat în diverse stiluri de decor, adăugând o notă de puritate și luminozitate. Designul cu stele o face o alegere minunată pentru camere de copii, dormitoare sau orice spațiu în care se dorește o atmosferă veselă și unică.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-04T16:49:00+03:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T17:54:52+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52429654491403,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT220\/3WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"119.79","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"129.99","position":1,"product_id":9757720477963,"created_at":"2025-09-30T16:55:43+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":70026935206155,"created_at":"2026-09-02T13:35:36+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:37:49+03:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_cu_telecomanda_IPOMOEA_51W_3_Stele_Lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb_Metal_si_Acril_1.png?v=1788345469","width":927,"height":927},{"id":62981190811915,"created_at":"2025-12-03T16:41:56+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-03T16:42:57+02:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT2203WH_1.png?v=1764772977","width":1586,"height":1586},{"id":51817418653963,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:54:54+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-12-03T16:42:57+02:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1-1739457497.webp?v=1764772977","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":62981190779147,"created_at":"2025-12-03T16:41:56+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-03T16:42:57+02:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT2203WH_2.png?v=1764772977","width":800,"height":800},{"id":52361310732555,"created_at":"2025-03-14T22:40:50+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-12-03T16:42:57+02:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lt800_3wh.webp?v=1764772977","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817418621195,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:54:54+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T09:57:16+03:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2-1739457498.webp?v=1778741836","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817418588427,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:54:54+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T09:55:09+03:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-kyle-84w-dimabila-alb-1721733290.webp?v=1778741709","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52822377529611,"created_at":"2025-04-02T10:47:33+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2025-12-03T16:42:57+02:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT220_3WH-LustraLEDcutelecomandaIPOMOEA_56W_3Stele_luminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Alb-2.jpg?v=1764772977","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":64131565060363,"created_at":"2026-01-05T17:00:03+02:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-01-05T17:00:07+02:00","product_id":9757720477963,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT220_3WH_EPREL.png?v=1767625207","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10238873501963,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda KARINA, 65W, 8 Elemente, Lumina Calda\/Rece\/Neutra, Dimabila, Auriu","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomnda-karina-65w-8-elemente-lumina-calda-rece-neutra-dimabila-auriu","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c3304092847-190\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c3304092847-190\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c3304092847-190\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_a06f6a43b80c213d\" style=\"--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLustra LED KARINA, o piesa de iluminat ce imbina estetica moderna cu functionalitatea avansata. Conceputa pentru a adauga o nota de rafinament, aceasta lustra este mai mult decat o sursa de lumina, este o declaratie de stil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Flexibila \u0026amp; Puternica:\u003c\/strong\u003e Beneficiati de o putere totala de \u003cstrong\u003e65W \u003c\/strong\u003esi un flux luminos generos de\u003cstrong\u003e 2358lm.\u003c\/strong\u003e Alegeti din cele trei temperaturi de culoare (calda, neutra, rece) si controlati lumina intuitiv, fie prin intrerupatorul clasic, fie prin telecomanda.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficienta Energetica \u0026amp; Durabilitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tehnologia LED avansata asigura un consum optim si o durata de viata remarcabila de 25.000 de ore, oferind economii semnificative pe termen lung si o intretinere minima.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLustra LED KARINA este solutia ideala pentru cei ce cauta o iluminare eficienta, estetica si durabila, transformand fiecare incapere intr-un spatiu plin de personalitate si un confort vizual exceptional, perfect pentru dormitor sau living.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-footer gap complete\"\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-footer ng-tns-c3304092847-190\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1770031853-193\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1770031853-193 ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-12T00:50:46+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-11T15:19:53+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","BF2025","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52429946126603,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT723\/8GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"377.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"377.99","position":1,"pro