42651915,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:39:26+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-05-21T14:25:10+03:00","product_id":9757937074443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-leila-telecomanda-150w-crom-negru-metal-cristal-dimabila_LL500_03.webp?v=1747826710","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819242684683,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:39:26+02:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2025-05-21T14:25:10+03:00","product_id":9757937074443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-leila-telecomanda-150w-crom-negru-metal-cristal-dimabila_LL500_04.webp?v=1747826710","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819242815755,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:39:26+02:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2025-05-21T14:25:10+03:00","product_id":9757937074443,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-leila-telecomanda-150w-crom-negru-metal-cristal-dimabila_LL500_05.webp?v=1747826710","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10240601817355,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda, GIO, 81W, Lumina Rece\/Clada\/Neutra, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-gio-81w-6-elemente-lumina-rece-clada-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:216\"\u003eLustra LED GIO, o declaratie de stil ce redefinește iluminatul modern. Aceasta piesa inovatoare este proiectata pentru a aduce lumina si eleganta, transformand orice spatiu intr-unul primitor si functional.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"3:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:236\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Minimalist \u0026amp; Alungit:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o forma liniara distinctiva si un finisaj alb pur, aceasta lustra cu 6 surse LED, fabricata din metal si aluminiu, adauga o nota de modernitate discreta, ideala pentru interioarele contemporane.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"4:1-4:255\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Dinamica \u0026amp; Generoasa:\u003c\/strong\u003e Beneficiaza de o putere de 82W ce genereaza un flux luminos impresionant de 15575lm. Personalizeaza atmosfera alegand dintre lumina calda, neutra sau rece, controland totul cu usurinta, clasic sau prin telecomanda.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePerformanta Durabila \u0026amp; Eficienta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tehnologia LED integrata asigura o durata de viata de 25.000 de ore, oferind o solutie de iluminat fiabila si extrem de eficienta energetic, reducand semnificativ costurile operationale.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:204\"\u003eLustra LED GIO este alegerea perfecta pentru cei ce cauta o combinatie de functionalitate superioara si estetica rafinata, ideala pentru a ilumina holuri, bucatarii sau livinguri cu un stil inconfundabil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:223\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-17T10:24:51+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-11T17:01:50+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52429947011339,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT172\/6WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"279.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"279.99