99371,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:36:15+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:34:42+03:00","product_id":9757505093899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_NEXA_Triunghi_3D_40W_Alb_Lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_3.webp?v=1784615682","width":900,"height":900},{"id":68895214305547,"created_at":"2026-05-14T13:41:17+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:35:44+03:00","product_id":9757505093899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_NEXA_Triunghi_3D_40W_Alb_Lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_9.png?v=1784615744","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69804771410187,"created_at":"2026-07-21T09:36:56+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:36:58+03:00","product_id":9757505093899,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2695699_big_color_07eba69a-cbc5-433b-b0fb-09c96a06492d.png?v=1784615818","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760030327051,"title":"Lustra LED CRINELLA 44W, Diametru 23cm, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra 3000K\/4000K\/6000K, Negru, Metal si Acril","handle":"lustra-led-crinella-44w-diametru-23cm-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED moderna\u003c\/strong\u003e, eleganta si usor de integrat in orice decor, adauga un plus de stil si rafinament in orice incapere. Designul sau ondulat atrage privirile si completeaza perfect atat spatiile rezidentiale, cat si cele comerciale, oferind un aspect contemporan si sofisticat.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEchipata cu \u003cstrong\u003edoua surse LED de 44W\u003c\/strong\u003e, aceasta lustra genereaza un flux luminos puternic de 3520 lumeni, asigurand o iluminare uniforma si eficienta. Lumina distribuita elimina umbrele neplacute si creeaza un ambient placut, indiferent de activitate. In functie de nevoi, poti alege intre trei temperaturi de culoare: \u003cstrong\u003elumina calda\u003c\/strong\u003e (3000K) ideala pentru momente de relaxare, \u003cstrong\u003elumina neutra\u003c\/strong\u003e (4000K) potrivita pentru activitatile de zi cu zi sau \u003cstrong\u003elumina rece\u003c\/strong\u003e (6000K) care ofera un aspect modern si energizant.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAceasta lustra este conceputa pentru a fi atat functionala, cat si economica. Tehnologia LED asigura un consum redus de energie fara a compromite intensitatea luminii, ceea ce inseamna facturi mai mici la electricitate si o durata de viata extinsa. Cu o autonomie de pana la 25.000 de ore, nu va trebui sa iti faci griji pentru inlocuirea frecventa a sursei de lumina.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFunctionarea este simpla si intuitiva, fiind compatibila cu un intrerupator clasic, fara setari complicate. Instalarea este usoara, iar constructia sa robusta si materialele de calitate asigura durabilitate si rezistenta in timp. Cu un grad de protectie IP20, este destinata utilizarii in interior, fiind ideala pentru holuri, livinguri, dormitoare sau birouri.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDaca iti doresti un iluminat eficient, un design modern si o atmosfera placuta in casa ta, aceasta lustra LED este alegerea perfecta!\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T01:24:58+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T01:24:58+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","iulie_26","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","SpringSale1","Summer_start"],"variants":[{"id":52372592525579,"ti