79968466","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9759729582347,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu telecomanda RIBBON 64W, Liniara, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru, Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-ribbon-64w-liniara-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă RIBBON\u003c\/strong\u003e, de \u003cstrong\u003e64W\u003c\/strong\u003e, se remarcă prin designul său fluid și modern, sugerând forma unei panglici elegante, finisată în negru. Această lustră nu este doar o sursă de lumină, ci și un element decorativ distinctiv, aducând un plus de stil oricărui interior. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOferă o iluminare versatilă, permițând alegerea între lumină rece, caldă sau neutră, pentru a se adapta diferitelor momente și preferințe. Funcția de dimare, controlată prin telecomanda inclusă, îți oferă posibilitatea de a \u003cstrong\u003eajusta intensitatea luminii\u003c\/strong\u003e, creând astfel ambianța perfectă. Un avantaj suplimentar este \u003cstrong\u003eînălțimea reglabilă\u003c\/strong\u003e, care permite adaptarea lustrei la specificul spațiului. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e64W\u003c\/strong\u003e, asigură o iluminare eficientă și plăcută, fiind ideală pentru livinguri, sufragerii sau alte zone în care se dorește un iluminat modern și adaptabil, cu un impact vizual interesant datorită designului său 'panglică' și finisajului negru.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T00:26:59+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T00:26:59+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52385287569675,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT101BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"339.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"339.99","position":1,"product_id":9759729582347,"created_at":"2025-09-19T09:51:46+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51836366061835,"created_at":"2025-02-25T00:27:00+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T15:35:47+03:00","product_id":9759729582347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-helina-116w-dimabila-alb-negru-1738615516.webp?v=1778762147","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52671444058379,"created_at":"2025-03-28T14:24:53+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T15:30:16+03:00","product_id":9759729582347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-Lustra_LED_Suspendata_cu_Telecomanda_RIBBON_66W_Inaltime_Reglabila_Lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-1.jpg?v=1778761816","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":67934072733963,"created_at":"2026-03-31T12:21:54+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T15:42:20+03:00","product_id":9759729582347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Mar_31_2026_12_21_34_PM.png?v=1778762540","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":52671444123915,"created_at":"2025-03-28T14:24:53+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-03-31T12:22:43+03:00","product_id":9759729582347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-Lustra_LED_Suspendata_cu_Telecomanda_RIBBON_66W_Inaltime_Reglabila_Lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru-2.jpg?v=1774948963","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":67934072766731,"created_at":"2026-03-31T12:21:54+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-03-31T12:22:43+03:00","product_id":9759729582347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/bc67fbc6-2fd1-4cf8-8737-3fdcbb1db776.png?v=1774948963","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68895722635531,"created_at":"2026-05-14T15:44:04+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-05-14T15:44:58+03:00","product_id":9759729582347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPTImage14mai2026_15_43_55.png?v=1778762698","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":66027697111307,"created_at":"2026-02-19T15:39:32+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-03-31T12:22:43+03:00","product_id":9759729582347,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT101BK_EPREL.png?v=1774948963","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757643800843,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda BETTY 27W, 2 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-betty-27w-2-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/17.BANNER_b241d81c-5cc6-4f38-a623-6bdc54f28f22.png?v=1778435336\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.alessandrodesign.ro\/upload\/userfiles\/images\/documentations\/banners\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp\"\u003eIluminare Practica pentru Holul Tau\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDescopera lustra LED BETTY, o solutie moderna si practica pentru iluminatul holului tau. Cu doua cercuri simple din acril si corp alb, aceasta lustra ofera iluminare eficienta si aspect placut.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eControl Convenabil al Luminii\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTelecomanda pentru ajustarea usoara a luminii\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTrei tipuri de lumina disponibile: calda, neutra si rece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIluminare decenta pentru spatii de trecere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eEconomic si Durabil\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCu un consum modest de 27W și o durată de viață de 25.000 ore, lustra BETTY este o alegere practica pentru iluminatul de zi cu zi.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDesign Simplu și Funcțional\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensiune potrivita: 41 cm lungime, pentru holuri standard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProfil discret cu inalțime de 9.5 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePotrivita pentru holuri si zone de trecere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e Sfat practic: Ideala pentru holuri unde ai nevoie de iluminare uniforma si control simplu al luminii.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSpecificatii Tehnice\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCu protectie IP20 pentru uz interior, lustra BETTY ofera iluminare constanta si posibilitatea de a regla intensitatea luminii dupa preferinte.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e O alegere practica pentru iluminatul holului tau, combinând simplitatea cu functionalitatea la un pret accesibil.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c!-- notionvc: 99c2ecbb-5d4f-4d59-8e15-49a2e8e5501e --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T17:28:39+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T17:28:38+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Summer_start"],"variants":[{"id":52414209491211,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT800\/2WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"89.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"89.99","position":1,"product_id":9757643800843,"created_at":"2025-09-26T07:29:41+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":68820069875979,"created_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:51+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:55+03:00","product_id":9757643800843,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/1.COVER_97a0234d-1646-473f-8e6e-0fd366fb986d.png?v=1778435335","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68820069908747,"created_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:51+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:56+03:00","product_id":9757643800843,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/2.CLOSEUP_cbe23266-d9ac-4747-8d13-49b08f8dbe96.png?v=1778435336","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68820069941515,"created_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:51+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:56+03:00","product_id":9757643800843,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/3.REMOTESHOW_aa5a1812-0ac1-4c7e-b0c3-3ca170c790d0.png?v=1778435336","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68820069974283,"created_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:51+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:56+03:00","product_id":9757643800843,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/4.STEPLESSDIMING_a9abe845-f894-4749-90fb-6a72d3055f56.png?v=1778435336","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68820070007051,"c