","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:56+03:00","product_id":9757643800843,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/14.PLACE3_39daa6b9-53f4-4baa-b88c-af96a0cdf851.png?v=1778435336","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":68820070236427,"created_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:51+03:00","position":12,"updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:48:56+03:00","product_id":9757643800843,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/15.PLACE4_4997bd2f-f981-40ff-987b-57b9b35aeb4c.png?v=1778435336","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":62998770843915,"created_at":"2025-12-04T14:04:37+02:00","position":13,"updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:07:07+02:00","product_id":9757643800843,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT800_2WH_EPREL.png?v=1765192027","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10840452497675,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda, LLC135\/2GD, Cristal si Metal, 54W, 2 Cerc, Dimabila, Inaltime Reglabila, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra 3000K\/4000K\/6000K, Iluminat Luxos","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-llc135-2gd-cristal-si-metal-55w-2-cerc-dimabila-inaltime-reglabila-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-iluminat-luxos","body_html":"\u003cp data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"0\"\u003eLustra LED cu Telecomandă LLC135\/2GD este un corp de iluminat premium, conceput pentru interioare elegante și spații moderne care pun accent pe lux și rafinament. Designul său circular, cu un singur cerc decorat cu elemente din cristal și structură metalică aurie, creează un efect vizual spectaculos și o lumină ambientală sofisticată.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"0\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"338\"\u003eCu o putere de 54W, lustra oferă iluminare eficientă și uniformă, fiind ideală pentru livinguri, dininguri sau dormitoare high-end. Funcția dimabilă și telecomanda inclusă permit control total asupra intensității și temperaturii de culoare, cu opțiuni de lumină caldă, neutră sau rece, adaptabile oricărui moment al zilei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"338\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"662\"\u003eÎnălțimea reglabilă asigură flexibilitate maximă la montaj, permițând integrarea armonioasă atât în spații cu tavan înalt, cât și în încăperi standard. Combinația dintre cristalul strălucitor și finisajul metalic auriu transformă lustra LLC135\/2GD într-un element statement, care nu doar iluminează, ci definește vizual întregul ambient.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"662\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1001\"\u003eO alegere ideală pentru cei care caută iluminat luxos, tehnologie modernă și control complet al atmosferei într-un singur produs.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-12-29T07:29:09+02:00","created_at":"2025-12-18T13:44:44+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","Ciresar 25","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52771348021515,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LLC135\/2GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"699.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"799.99","position":1,"product_id":10840452497675,"created_at":"2025-12-18T13:44:45+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":63562516463883,"created_at":"2025-12-18T14:17:18+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T14:24:40+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Dec_18_2025_02_17_07_PM.png?v=1766060680","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63560550056203,"created_at":"2025-12-18T13:37:18+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T14:24:40+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/A_e51ad1b1-50c8-4b21-9f8c-50b316e18d75.png?v=1766060680","width":2500,"height":2500},{"id":63561661120779,"created_at":"2025-12-18T13:59:49+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T14:24:40+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPS_Photos_2_27fed376-1610-44ed-8994-816572e2e6de.jpg?v=1766060680","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":63560854044939,"created_at":"2025-12-18T13:43:40+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-12-18T14:24:40+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_84c181c9-ab35-451d-9608-0c3507cc6616.png?v=1766060680","width":2500,"height":2500},{"id":64518960349451,"created_at":"2026-01-19T17:40:42+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:40:56+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Jan_19_2026_05_40_33_PM.png?v=1768837256","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":63561228779787,"created_at":"2025-12-18T13:51:26+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:40:56+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/ChatGPT_Image_Dec_18_2025_01_51_17_PM.png?v=1768837256","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":64518974374155,"created_at":"2026-01-19T17:42:26+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:42:39+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_1ffb3782-c217-43d6-8dd5-4a822190ba15.png?v=1768837359","width":1800,"height":1800},{"id":63560550121739,"created_at":"2025-12-18T13:37:18+02:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-01-19T17:42:39+02:00","product_id":10840452497675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_dc8e51ce-3b4e-4ad5-92ea-eef98589a93b.png?v=1768837359","width":2500,"height":2500}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":11001485099275,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda ALANI 200W, 8 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-alani-200w-8-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"chat-history-scroll-container\" id=\"chat-history\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"7f55e9cf5062774d\" class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary tts-removed ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container ng-tns-c1310598610-120 response-container-with-gpi tts-removed ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c1310598610-120\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c1310598610-120\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c1310598610-120\"\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_7f55e9cf5062774d\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:206\"\u003eAceastă lustră LED cu telecomandă, de 200W și culoare maro, impresionează prin designul său modern cu 8 cercuri luminoase și oferă o iluminare extrem de versatilă, fiind potrivită pentru spații ample.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:30\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici principale:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-14:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:100\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere impresionantă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 200W, asigurând o iluminare puternică și eficientă pentru încăperi mari.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:83\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu 8 cercuri elegante, adaugă un element de design sofisticat.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:153\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip de lumină reglabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Oferă posibilitatea de a alege între lumină rece, caldă și neutră, adaptându-se perfect diferitelor momente și preferințe.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:129\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Intensitatea luminii poate fi ajustată cu ușurință prin telecomanda inclusă, permițând crearea atmosferei ideale.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:217\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl inteligent:\u003c\/strong\u003e Telecomanda oferă control complet asupra temperaturii culorii și a intensității luminii. Lustra poate fi controlată și prin întrerupătorul clasic (apăsări succesive modifică tipul de lumină).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:83\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlux luminos ridicat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Asigură o iluminare optimă și confortabilă a spațiului.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:79\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurată de viață lungă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tehnologia LED garantează o utilizare îndelungată.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:68\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMateriale de calitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Asigură rezistență și un aspect plăcut.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-14:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUșor de instalat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Include instrucțiuni detaliate.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:181\"\u003eAceastă lustră LED  combină un design atrăgător cu o funcționalitate avansată, oferind o soluție de iluminat puternică, eficientă energetic și complet adaptabilă nevoilor tale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"input-area-container ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-13T13:06:35+03:00","created_at":"2026-07-13T13:05:01+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate"],"variants":[{"id":53238080504075,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-VV1A-HT2L-8067\/4+4intBK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"219.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"379.99","position":1,"product_id":11001485099275,"created_at":"2026-07-13T13:05:02+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69754652524811,"created_at":"2026-07-13T13:06:26+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-13T13:06:30+03:00","product_id":11001485099275,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/8067-4_4BK.jpg?v=1783937190","width":3378,"height":3543}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10889050358027,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda ZYRON Magno, 79W, 46x5.5x7.5, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb, Metal, Plexiglas","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-zyron-magno-79w-46x5-5x7-5-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb-metal-plexiglas","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:226\"\u003eIluminează-ți spațiul cu un design modern și o funcționalitate avansată oferită de lustra LED liniară. Corpul său elegant și minimalist, de culoare \u003cstrong\u003ealba\u003c\/strong\u003e, aduce un plus de lumină și stil contemporan oricărei încăperi.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:249\"\u003eCu o putere generoasă de \u003cstrong\u003e79W\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustra oferă o iluminare amplă și uniformă, ideală pentru livinguri, dininguri sau birouri moderne. Bucură-te de versatilitatea \u003cstrong\u003etrei tipuri de lumină\u003c\/strong\u003e integrate, adaptabile oricărei atmosfere și activități:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:112\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRece (alb):\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfectă pentru activități care necesită concentrare și energie, cum ar fi lucrul sau cititul.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:115\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCaldă (galben):\u003c\/strong\u003e Creează un ambient primitor și relaxant, ideal pentru serile liniștite sau mesele în familie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNeutră:\u003c\/strong\u003e O lumină echilibrată, potrivită pentru iluminatul general de zi cu zi.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:204\"\u003eGrație funcției \u003cstrong\u003edimabile\u003c\/strong\u003e, ai control total asupra intensității luminoase. Ajustează lumina de la o strălucire puternică la o lumină ambientală subtilă, creând atmosfera perfectă pentru fiecare moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:168\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTelecomanda inclusă\u003c\/strong\u003e adaugă un nivel superior de confort. Schimbă temperatura culorii, reglează intensitatea luminii și pornește sau oprește lustra fără a te ridica.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:25\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"19:1-25:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:71\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Liniar Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Corp elegant și minimalist de culoare alba..\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:67\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere Generoasă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 79W, oferind o iluminare amplă și uniformă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:80\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrei Tipuri de Lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rece, Caldă și Neutră, pentru versatilitate maximă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:83\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFuncție Dimmabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează intensitatea luminoasă în funcție de preferințe.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:65\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTelecomandă Inclusă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Control facil și comod de la distanță.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"24:1-25:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStil Versatil:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioare moderne, minimaliste sau scandinave.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:14\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"28:1-33:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:104\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Adaptabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alege temperatura de culoare și intensitatea perfectă pentru fiecare ocazie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:73\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eControl Total:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ajustează lumina confortabil cu telecomanda inclusă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:81\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficiență Energetică LED:\u003c\/strong\u003e Consum redus de energie și durată de viață lungă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:92\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Elegant și Discret:\u003c\/strong\u003e Un element de iluminat modern care completează orice decor.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"32:1-33:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Uniformă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideal pentru a lumina eficient spații mari.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"34:1-34:214\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă liniară este alegerea ideală pentru a adăuga un plus de stil, confort și control inteligent în iluminatul casei tale. Bucură-te de flexibilitatea luminii perfecte la un singur click!\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"34:1-34:214\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-02-23T14:09:07+02:00","created_at":"2026-02-20T10:51:30+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52913925849355,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT755\/4WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"199.79","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"219.99","position":1,"product_id":10889050358027,"created_at":"2026-02-20T10:51:30+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":66080039207179,"created_at":"2026-02-20T10:53:16+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-02-20T10:53:53+02:00","product_id":10889050358027,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos_1_a92a8f30-63bb-45cd-828f-f5255f76ead1.png?v=1771577633","width":900,"height":900},{"id":66080039174411,"created_at":"2026-02-20T10:53:16+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-02-20T10:53:53+02:00","product_id":10889050358027,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos2_923533b2-bc86-4e36-91de-3a4a11d5295d.jpg?v=1771577633","width":796,"height":796},{"id":68251419050251,"created_at":"2026-04-14T14:09:07+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-04-14T14:09:10+03:00","product_id":10889050358027,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lt755-4wh.png?v=1776164950","width":204,"height":408}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9759483166987,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda si cristal NOVA ROTONDA RGB 82W, 4 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Crom","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-si-cristal-nova-rotonda-rgb-82w-4-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-crom","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eAdauga un accent contemporan si elegant spatiului tau cu lustra LED Nova Rotonda, o piesa ce imbina designul modern cu detalii pretioase din cristale. Cele \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e4 surse principale de lumina LED\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e asigura o iluminare eficienta, iar \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003esursa RGB ambientala integrata\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e creeaza un joc de lumini colorate spectaculos, perfect pentru a schimba atmosfera unei incaperi printr-o simpla apasare de buton.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e✔️ Dimensiuni: 45x32x22 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e✔️ Putere: 82W\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e✔️ Iluminare: 4 surse LED + 1 sursa RGB ambientala\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e✔️ Lumina: Rece \/ Calda \/ Neutra + RGB\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e✔️ Control: Telecomanda inclusa pentru schimbarea culorii si intensitatii\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e✔️ Materiale: metal finisat crom lucios + cristale acrilice\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e✔️ Potrivita pentru: living modern, dormitor, hol, birou, camera de zi\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003eLustra Nova Rotonda este alegerea ideala pentru cei care doresc nu doar iluminare, ci si \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eambienta vizuala spectaculoasa\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, fara lanturi, montaj aplicat direct pe tavan. Adauga stil si tehnologie inteligenta in caminul tau cu acest corp de iluminat sofisticat!\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T23:54:36+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T23:54:36+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","ciresar","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52428543459595,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT075\/4","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"239.97","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"279.99","position":1,"product_id":9759483166987,"created_at":"2025-09-30T14:15:39+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":69876280951051,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:29+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/011_11_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875309","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280721675,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/004_04_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280623371,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:29+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/001_01_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875309","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280656139,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/002_02_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280754443,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/005_05_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280787211,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/006_06_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280819979,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/007_07_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280852747,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:29+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/008_08_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875309","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280885515,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/009_09_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1600,"height":1600},{"id":69876280918283,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/010_10_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69876280983819,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:27+03:00","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:28:30+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/012_12_LT075-4.webp?v=1785875310","width":1254,"height":1254},{"id":69883616067851,"created_at":"2026-08-06T15:25:49+03:00","position":12,"updated_at":"2026-08-06T15:25:52+03:00","product_id":9759483166987,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2524141_big_color.png?v=1786019152","width":425,"height":850}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760744145163,"title":"Lustra LED ROCKET 49W, Diametru 49cm, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Alb Albastru","handle":"lustra-led-rocket-75w-diametru-49cm-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-alb-albastru","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:175\"\u003eLustra LED ROCKET, cu o putere de 49W și un diametru de 49.99 cm, oferă o iluminare versatilă, având opțiuni pentru lumină rece, caldă sau neutră, și vine într-o culoare albă.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:51\"\u003eDin rezultatele căutării, reiese că această lustră:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-10:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:168\"\u003eAre un \u003cstrong\u003edesign inovator\u003c\/strong\u003e inspirat de forma unei rachete, fiind potrivită pentru camere de copii, birouri moderne sau spații care necesită un punct focal interesant.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:114\"\u003eOferă o \u003cstrong\u003eiluminare eficientă\u003c\/strong\u003e datorită tehnologiei LED, cunoscută pentru durabilitatea și economia de energie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:90\"\u003eAre un \u003cstrong\u003efinisaj alb elegant\u003c\/strong\u003e, integrându-se ușor în diverse stiluri de decor interior.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:54\"\u003eEste realizată din \u003cstrong\u003emateriale de înaltă calitate\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-10:0\"\u003eVine cu toate componentele necesare pentru o \u003cstrong\u003emontare ușoară\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:17:46+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:17:46+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Copii","tags":["