:34:26+03:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-07-31T23:34:29+03:00","product_id":9779347915019,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/008_08_LT071-4CH.webp?v=1785530069","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10133574582539,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda NUVIA 71W, Nor, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-nuvia-71w-nor-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"571\" class=\"\"\u003eLustra LED NUVIA  îți oferă control complet asupra atmosferei din cameră. Cu o putere de 71W și trei tipuri de lumină – rece, caldă și neutră – se adaptează perfect oricărui spațiu și moment al zilei. Funcția dimabilă permite ajustarea intensității luminii exact așa cum ai nevoie, iar telecomanda inclusă îți oferă acces rapid la toate setările, fără să te ridici din fotoliu.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"755\" class=\"\"\u003eDesignul alb, discret și modern, se integrează ușor în camere de zi, dormitoare sau birouri. Ideală pentru cei care caută o sursă de lumină eficientă, versatilă și ușor de controlat.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T15:38:32+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-14T20:12:50+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate"],"variants":[{"id":52428747342091,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT643\/500WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"199.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"239.99","position":1,"product_id":10133574582539,"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:27:21+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":59608787878155,"created_at":"2025-08-28T11:45:26+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-28T11:45:30+03:00","product_id":10133574582539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos_1_6a23045a-079b-4b75-87ed-f91e64144830.png?v=1756370730","width":800,"height":800},{"id":66223631302923,"created_at":"2026-02-22T19:47:15+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-02-22T19:47:23+02:00","product_id":10133574582539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT643_500WH.webp?v=1771782443","width":800,"height":800},{"id":62529209925899,"created_at":"2025-11-20T18:14:29+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-02-22T19:47:23+02:00","product_id":10133574582539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT643_500WH_EPREL_6a44a566-2fb1-4124-b4d4-bca457b25af5.png?v=1771782443","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9759765233931,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu telecomanda ADELAIDA 226W, 4 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru, Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-adelaida-226w-4-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cdiv id=\"9977e5f0bf836b3e\" class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container ng-tns-c1542659755-15 response-container-with-gpi ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c1542659755-15\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c1542659755-15\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c1542659755-15\"\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_9977e5f0bf836b3e\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel enable-updated-hr-color\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"7f5e1667d5f22c95\" class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container ng-tns-c1542659755-67 response-container-with-gpi ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c1542659755-67\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c1542659755-67\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c1542659755-67\"\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_7f5e1667d5f22c95\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel enable-updated-hr-color\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:303\"\u003eLustra LED suspendată cu telecomandă ADELAIDA este o piesă de iluminat modernă și puternică, cu un design format din 4 cercuri concentrice, finisate în negru. Cu o putere impresionantă de 226W, este ideală pentru a ilumina spații mari, oferind în același timp flexibilitate datorită înălțimii reglabile.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:610\"\u003eCele patru cercuri negre, dispuse probabil la diferite înălțimi sau într-un mod care creează un efect vizual dinamic, sunt iluminate de LED-uri cu posibilitatea de a selecta temperatura culorii. Prin intermediul telecomenzii, poți alege între lumină rece (pentru un ambient energizant), caldă (pentru o atmosferă primitoare și relaxantă) sau neutră (pentru iluminare generală). Funcția de dimare îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminii pentru a se potrivi perfect oricărui moment. În plus, posibilitatea de a regla înălțimea o face adaptabilă diferitelor înălțimi ale tavanului și preferințelor de design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:298\"\u003eFinisajul negru accentuează liniile moderne ale designului circular și adaugă o notă de eleganță și sobrietate încăperii. Cu o putere de 226W, este perfectă pentru a ilumina livinguri mari, sufragerii sau alte spații ample unde se dorește un element de design modern și o iluminare personalizabilă.\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T00:34:42+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T00:34:41+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52365395263755,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-5176BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"512.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"539.99","position":1,"product_id":9759765233931,"created_at":"2025-09-13T13:45:33+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51837035086091,"created_at":"2025-02-25T00:34:43+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-25T00:34:44+02:00","product_id":9759765233931,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-adelaida-226w-dimabila-alb-negru_AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-5176BK_01.webp?v=1740436484","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10223959310603,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata FAUSTO, 48W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Inaltime Reglabila, Auriu","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-fausto-48w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-inaltime-reglabila-auriu","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c4241358427-38\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c4241358427-38\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c4241358427-38\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_5bc2d3eed1041047\" style=\"--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:255\"\u003eLustra FAUSTO ofera un design actual, combinand acrilul cu metalul auriu, fiind o alegere potrivita pentru a completa atmosfera in living, bucatarie sau zona de dining. Forma circulara si cele doua elemente decorative contribuie la o estetica echilibrata.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:33\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii pentru spatiul tau:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-13:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:330\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumina personalizata:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ai control complet asupra luminii, putand alege intre o ambianta calda (3000K), o lumina echilibrata pentru activitati (4000K) sau o iluminare energizanta (6000K). Acest lucru iti permite sa ajustezi atmosfera in functie de momentul zilei sau de eveniment, de la o cina relaxanta la o sesiune de lucru.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:205\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlexibilitate in reglare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Datorita functiei de dimare si a telecomenzii incluse, poti ajusta intensitatea luminii cu usurinta, obtinand intotdeauna nivelul de confort vizual dorit, fara a te deplasa.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:263\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdaptabilitate dimensionala:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cele doua elemente, impreuna cu inaltimea reglabila, iti ofera flexibilitate in amenajare. Poti integra lustra in spatii diverse, de la cele intime la cele mai ample, asigurand proportia potrivita.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"12:1-13:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurabilitate si eficienta:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sursa de iluminat LED integrata este proiectata pentru o durata lunga de viata (25.000 ore), reducand necesitatea inlocuirii frecvente si oferind un consum energetic eficient pe termen lung.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:133\"\u003eFAUSTO este proiectata pentru a oferi o solutie de iluminat fiabila si estetica, adaptata nevoilor cotidiene in interiorul locuintei.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:133\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:133\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:133\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:133\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-footer gap complete\"\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e