 3000K\/4000K\/6000K","handle":"lustra-led-8056bn-57w-acril-maro-lumina-3000k-4000k-6000k","body_html":"\u003carticle data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-10\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"13bacc8f-850f-4738-bb68-957be62e0ed8\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"\u003e\u003carticle data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-10\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"13bacc8f-850f-4738-bb68-957be62e0ed8\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"\u003e\n\u003carticle data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-10\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"13bacc8f-850f-4738-bb68-957be62e0ed8\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"332\" data-start=\"58\"\u003eLustra LED 8056BN se remarcă prin designul modern și finisajul elegant din \u003cstrong data-end=\"151\" data-start=\"137\"\u003eacril maro\u003c\/strong\u003e, aducând un plus de stil și rafinament în orice interior. Cu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e57\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"245\" data-start=\"225\"\u003eW LED integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferă iluminare eficientă și uniformă, perfectă pentru living, dormitor sau dining.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"334\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"336\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 57W LED integrat\u003cbr data-end=\"367\" data-start=\"364\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"393\" data-start=\"369\"\u003eTemperatură culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000K (caldă) \/ 4000K (neutră) \/ 6000K (rece)\u003cbr data-end=\"442\" data-start=\"439\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"457\" data-start=\"444\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Acril + Metal\u003cbr data-end=\"474\" data-start=\"471\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"476\"\u003eFinisaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maro elegant\u003cbr data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"501\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"506\"\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interior – living, dormitor, sufragerie, birou\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"726\" data-start=\"571\"\u003eLustra LED 8056BN îmbină funcționalitatea cu estetica modernă, fiind o alegere ideală pentru cei care caută \u003cstrong data-end=\"723\" data-start=\"679\"\u003econfort, eficiență și design contemporan\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px\" data-e