:00","product_id":9758288609547,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT100BK.webp?v=1771764779","width":1080,"height":1080}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10716549808395,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda ,Suspendata 96W, 4 Elemente, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Inaltime Reglabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-suspendata-96w-4-elemente-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"chat-history-scroll-container\" id=\"chat-history\"\u003e\u003cdiv id=\"5e11a03670470d98\" class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary tts-removed ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container ng-tns-c1310598610-90 response-container-with-gpi tts-removed ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c1310598610-90\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c1310598610-90\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c1310598610-90\"\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_5e11a03670470d98\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"108\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/15._Cover_content.jpg?v=1772921491\" alt=\"\"\u003eLustra LED suspendată 96W cu 4 elemente în finisaj negru mat este un corp de iluminat modern, cu design geometric echilibrat și impact vizual puternic. Configurația cu inele suprapuse oferă dinamism și volum, fiind ideală pentru spații contemporane și amenajări minimaliste.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/IN_VS_LED.png?v=1772904965\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"408\" data-start=\"384\"\u003eSpecificații tehnice\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"409\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"443\" data-start=\"409\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"443\" data-start=\"411\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"422\" data-start=\"411\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 96W (LED integrat)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"444\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"446\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"461\" data-start=\"446\"\u003eTip lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rece \/ Caldă \/ Neutră (selectabilă)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"500\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"502\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"502\"\u003eFuncție dimare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Da – reglare intensitate\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"585\" data-start=\"549\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"585\" data-start=\"551\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"563\" data-start=\"551\"\u003eControl:\u003c\/strong\u003e Telecomandă inclusă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"586\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"588\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"588\"\u003eDimensiuni:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60 x 26 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"617\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"619\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"619\"\u003eÎnălțime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Reglabilă (sistem de suspendare ajustabil)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"678\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"680\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"680\"\u003eCuloare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Negru\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"744\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"744\" data-start=\"703\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"703\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal + dispersor acrilic\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"745\"\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"747\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"747\"\u003eMontaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e Suspendat\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"803\" data-start=\"772\"\u003eFuncționalități și avantaje\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"804\"\u003e✔ Selectarea temperaturii de culoare pentru diferite scenarii de iluminare\u003cbr data-end=\"881\" data-start=\"878\"\u003e✔ Intensitate reglabilă pentru ambient personalizat\u003cbr data-end=\"935\" data-start=\"932\"\u003e✔ Înălțime ajustabilă – adaptabilă la diferite tipuri de tavane\u003cbr data-end=\"1001\" data-start=\"998\"\u003e✔ Distribuție uniformă a luminii\u003cbr data-end=\"1036\" data-start=\"1033\"\u003e✔ Consum redus și durată mare de viață a LED-urilor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1228\"\u003ePrin combinația dintre designul modern în finisaj negru și controlul inteligent al iluminării, această lustra LED de 96W oferă echilibru între estetică, eficiență și versatilitate, devenind un element central în orice interior modern.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"container hidden ng-star-inserted\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-09-12T09:48:02+03:00","created_at":"2025-09-09T21:20:23+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:17+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","BF2025","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52428751700235,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT751\/4BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"239.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"399.99","position":1,"product_id